{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J3hcSXW941sspPniXdmQPi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — gen-depth-fingerprint\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- **Primary: EMNLP 2026 Findings (ARR deadline: May 25, 2026)** — D012: 恢复为主投稿目标\n5\t- Positioning: **Findings paper**（非 main conference long paper）\n6\t- Fallback venues: ICLR 2027 (Sep 24), NAACL 2027 ARR (Oct 16)\n7\t\n8\t## Core Insight\n9\tNon-paraphrastic LLM generation chains exhibit **differential depth response** (DDR): **central-tendency/diversity features** (entropy_mean, TTR, hapax ratio) drift monotonically with depth, while **shape features** (entropy_max, tail_decay) remain near-stationary. This is consistent with recursive generation inducing a **location shift** in the NLL distribution while approximately preserving distributional shape. The contribution is: (a) the **task formulation** (generation depth classification beyond binary detection), (b) **empirical validation** across 8 generators / 5 model families (Pythia, OLMo, Qwen, Llama, Mistral; 0.6B–8B) showing DDR is robust, (c) a lightweight 7-feature ensemble achieving leak-free binary F1 = 0.694 under 8-gen LOGO. Depth signal degrades substantially under instruction tuning, restricting current scope to base models.\n10\t\n11\t## Core Claims (3 条，均可证伪)\n12\t\n13\t**Claim 1 — Depth Discriminability**: A 7-feature distributional ensemble can classify generation depth (gen-0 / gen-1 / gen-2+) with leak-free binary F1 = 0.694 (95% CI [0.688, 0.700]) under 8-generator LOGO evaluation, generalizing across unseen generators and model families (LOFO binary F1 = 0.686). Cross-model chains yield binary F1 = 0.830 under generator-level LOGO (5-gen subset). Primary metric is leak-free binary F1 (gen-1 vs gen-2+), excluding gen-0 to avoid seed-sharing leakage.\n14\t\n15\t**Claim 2 — Differential Depth Response & Feature Complementarity**: Features exhibit DDR: drifting features show |ρ| > 0.60 (hapax −0.63, TTR −0.61, entropy_mean −0.60), while shape features show |ρ| < 0.10 (tail_decay 0.04). KS statistics confirm: drifting 0.516–0.537 vs shape 0.043–0.052 (~10× gap). Full 7-feature set (10-fold CV F1 = 0.773) outperforms surface-only (0.688) and reference-only (0.713; McNemar p ≈ 0). Reference-only yields higher binary F1 (0.833 vs 0.695) but surface features are essential for 3-class gen-0 discrimination.\n16\t\n17\t**Claim 3 — Downstream Utility (Negative Finding)**: Depth-aware data curation does NOT improve downstream CLM quality. At equal sample count (n=3,951): random subsampling (ppl=2.367) outperforms depth 0–1 (2.387) and binary-filtered (2.389). TOST confirms equivalence at ±2% margin (p = 1.1×10⁻⁴). Full dataset (n=12,299, ppl=2.335) vs depth-filtered requires ±3% margin for equivalence. Depth fingerprinting is a **diagnostic** tool for provenance characterization, not a **curative** tool for data selection.\n18\t\n19\t## Headline Metrics Summary\n20\t\n21\t| Metric | Value | Context |\n22\t|--------|-------|---------|\n23\t| **Primary: LOGO binary F1** | **0.694** [0.688, 0.700] | 8-gen LOGO, gen-1 vs gen-2+, leak-free |\n24\t| LOGO 3-class F1 | 0.762 [0.758, 0.766] | Inflated by gen-0 seed sharing |\n25\t| Cross-model binary F1 | 0.830 | 5-gen subset, generator-level LOGO |\n26\t| Cross-model 3-class F1 | 0.789 | 5-gen subset, generator-level LOGO |\n27\t| LOFO binary F1 | 0.686 | Leave-one-family-out |\n28\t| Per-gen binary F1 range | 0.633–0.724 | Mistral-7B lowest, Pythia-2.8B highest |\n29\t| 9-gen LOGO 3-class F1 | 0.751 | +Gemma-2-2B; Gemma gen-1 F1=0.036 anomaly |\n30\t| DDR causality | 6/7 Granger sig, 5.5× perm imp gap | Drifting dominance confirmed |\n31\t| Feature ablation (10-fold CV) | Full 0.773, Surface 0.688, Ref 0.713 | McNemar p ≈ 0 |\n32\t| Length-matched binary F1 | 0.724 vs 0.770 unmatched | Deconfounding, not sample-size effect |\n33\t\n34\t## Scope & Limitations (必须在论文中突出)\n35\t\n36\t1. **Base models only**: Instruct-tuned models show substantially degraded signal (OLMo-Instruct LOGO F1 = 0.338 vs 0.763 base). Alignment-imposed length regulation and format constraints compress the distributional variation DDR exploits. This is the **primary scope limitation**.\n37\t2. **Temperature sensitivity**: Reliable within t ∈ [0.5, 0.9] (≤1 pp degradation from default t=0.7). At t = 1.0: −6 pp degradation; entropy_mean ρ drops from −0.60 to −0.002. Cross-temperature transfer degrades severely (t=0.7 → t=1.0: Qwen3-1.7B F1 drops 0.789 → 0.418).\n38\t3. **7-feature ensemble is not optimal**: Multi-detector ensembles (4-det + surface) achieve 3-class 0.795 vs 0.774 (+2.1 pp) and binary 0.708 vs 0.705 (+0.3 pp), but at 2.4× inference cost and 3.2× GPU memory. 7-feature positioned on **efficiency advantage**, not absolute performance.\n39\t4. **3-class resolution ceiling**: 5-class F1 drops to ~0.50; ordinal methods (CORAL, Frank-Hall) yield no improvement over standard XGBoost. Gen-1/gen-2+ boundary is the bottleneck (concentrates 86% of binary errors as FNs).\n40\t5. **Scale effect**: Larger generators show moderate degradation (Mistral-7B: 0.633, Qwen3-8B: 0.692 vs average 0.694). Higher-capacity models compress feature margins.\n41\t6. **Prompt-type dependence**: Continuation chains show stronger drift (F1 = 0.781) than elaboration (0.730).\n42\t\n43\t## Story Spine\n44\t\n45\t**Problem**: Web-scraped training data increasingly contains LLM-generated text of unknown provenance depth (7–17% of recent scientific papers). Current detection methods offer only binary real-vs-synthetic classification, conflating qualitatively different material: gen-1 retains much of the source distribution's lexical properties, while deeper text exhibits measurably reduced vocabulary diversity and compressed perplexity.\n46\t\n47\t**Existing approaches & gaps**: Binary detectors (FastDetectGPT, Binoculars, LD-Score) cannot distinguish gen-1 from gen-2+. Attractor cycle theory (ACL 2025) bounds paraphrasing chains to ~3 classes but depends on semantic-preservation constraints. No existing method addresses generation depth estimation in non-paraphrastic continuation chains. When repurposed as ordinal depth predictors, single detector scores show moderate signal but high cross-generator variance.\n48\t\n49\t**Our framing**: We formulate generation depth classification (gen-0/gen-1/gen-2+) and characterize DDR across 8 base-model generators from 5 families (0.6B–8B). Central-tendency features drift monotonically while shape features remain near-stationary, consistent with recursive generation inducing a location shift in the NLL distribution. A 7-feature ensemble achieves leak-free binary F1 = 0.694 under 8-gen LOGO with a single 410M reference model. Multi-detector ensembles achieve marginally higher F1 at 2.4× cost. The signal degrades under instruction tuning and high temperature, restricting current scope to base models at moderate temperatures.\n50\t\n51\t**Headline result template**: \"On 8 base-model generators from 5 families (0.6B–8B), our 7-feature ensemble achieves leak-free binary F1 = 0.694 under LOGO evaluation and 0.830 on cross-model chains, using a single 410M reference model. Depth-aware curation is statistically equivalent to random subsampling for downstream CLM quality (TOST p = 1.1×10⁻⁴ at ±2% margin), establishing depth fingerprinting as a diagnostic tool for provenance characterization.\"\n52\t\n53\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n54\t\n55\t**RC1 — \"Is this just vocabulary impoverishment?\"**: Surface features alone achieve 0.688, but full features achieve 0.773 (McNemar p ≈ 0). Reference features capture different, complementary signal. Reference-only yields higher binary F1 (0.833) but misses gen-0 discrimination. The complementarity itself is a finding.\n56\t\n57\t**RC2 — \"Does this generalize beyond Pythia?\"**: 8 generators from 5 families (Pythia, OLMo, Qwen, Llama, Mistral). LOFO binary F1 = 0.686 confirms cross-family transfer. Cross-model chains (heterogeneous generators per depth step) yield binary F1 = 0.764.\n58\t\n59\t**RC3 — \"Is 3-class sufficient?\"**: 5-class F1 drops to ~0.50. Ordinal methods (CORAL, Frank-Hall) yield no improvement. Gen-1/gen-2+ boundary is the resolution bottleneck. 3 classes represent practical ceiling.\n60\t\n61\t**RC4 — \"How realistic are single-model chains?\"**: Cross-model chains (different generator per step) are evaluated and yield higher F1 (0.764 binary), suggesting generator heterogeneity amplifies distributional shifts.\n62\t\n63\t**RC5 — \"What about human editing?\"**: Robustness test with simulated human edits (random word replacement + LLM-simulated editing). Reported in appendix.\n64\t\n65\t**RC6 — \"Ecological validity?\"**: Multi-domain seeds (news, Wikipedia, scientific, creative) + multiple prompt types (continuation, elaboration, rewriting). Prompt-type dependence reported transparently (continuation 0.781 vs elaboration 0.730).\n66\t\n67\t**RC8 — \"Aren't these just OOD detection features?\"**: Contribution is NOT the features but: (a) ordinal depth estimation formulation, (b) empirical DDR discovery (drifting vs stationary), (c) Findings-level empirical characterization. Paper explicitly connects to OOD/perplexity-based detection literature.\n68\t\n69\t**RC9 — \"Only base models — what about instruct?\"**: Acknowledged as primary limitation. OLMo-Instruct LOGO F1 = 0.338 vs 0.763 base. Instruction tuning compresses the distributional variation DDR exploits. Reported transparently; defines scope boundary.\n70\t\n71\t**RC10 — \"Text length confound\"**: Length-matched subsampling: binary F1 = 0.724 (vs 0.770 unmatched). Random-subsample control confirms drop reflects deconfounding, not sample-size reduction.\n72\t\n73\t**RC11 — \"Downstream — limited evidence\"**: Three seeds, single perplexity metric. TOST equivalence confirmed at ±2% margin for equal-count comparison. Margin sensitivity analysis across ±1%–5% reported. Cohen's d inflated by low seed-level variance; TOST is the appropriate test.\n74\t\n75\t## Contribution Positioning (Findings Level)\n76\tThe contribution is **empirical and conceptual**, appropriate for Findings:\n77\t1. **Problem formulation**: Generation depth classification as a new task beyond binary detection (no prior work addresses this in non-paraphrastic chains)\n78\t2. **Empirical characterization**: DDR across 8 generators / 5 families (0.6B–8B), with cross-generator generalization (LOGO binary F1 = 0.694, LOFO 0.686, cross-model 0.764). Honest reporting of scope boundaries (instruct degradation, temperature sensitivity, scale effect).\n79\t3. **Negative finding**: Depth-aware curation ≡ random subsampling for downstream quality (TOST confirmed). Depth fingerprinting is diagnostic, not curative.\n80\t\n81\t**Framing discipline:**\n82\t- Do NOT call the drift/stationarity split a \"discovery\" — it follows from location-shift properties of the NLL distribution. Acknowledge explicitly.\n83\t- Do NOT use H1/H2 terminology. Use \"drifting\" vs \"stationary\" or \"differential response.\"\n84\t- Do NOT overclaim \"dual dynamics.\" Use \"differential depth response\" (DDR).\n85\t- Report **realistic performance range** (binary F1 0.633–0.724 per-generator, 0.694 LOGO average) in abstract/conclusion, not best-case.\n86\t- Primary metric is leak-free binary F1 (not 3-class, which is inflated by gen-0 seed sharing).\n87\t- 7-feature ensemble is positioned on efficiency, not absolute superiority over multi-detector ensembles.\n88\t\n89\tRelated work must cover: perplexity-based detection (DetectGPT, GLTR, DNA-GPT, Binoculars), model collapse theory, OOD detection, data quality scoring, watermarking, vocabulary diversity, stylometry/authorship attribution, iterative generation (LLM as Broken Telephone ACL 2025), membership inference.\n90\t\n91\t## Venue Fit\n92\t- EMNLP 2026 Findings: Excellent fit — directly addresses data contamination, synthetic data feedback loops, data governance. Empirical/conceptual contribution with honest scope boundaries. Findings-appropriate ambition level: novel task formulation + solid characterization, not a state-of-the-art methodology claim.\n93\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"12403ebc-9514-4215-82a8-4a9860541744","uuid":"ef7d0931-a681-4d6a-a2f2-62db39bbf1ea","timestamp":"2026-05-20T10:27:37.215Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_3/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T100349/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — gen-depth-fingerprint\n\n## Target Venue\n- **Primary: EMNLP 2026 Findings (ARR deadline: May 25, 2026)** — D012: 恢复为主投稿目标\n- Positioning: **Findings paper**（非 main conference long paper）\n- Fallback venues: ICLR 2027 (Sep 24), NAACL 2027 ARR (Oct 16)\n\n## Core Insight\nNon-paraphrastic LLM generation chains exhibit **differential depth response** (DDR): **central-tendency/diversity features** (entropy_mean, TTR, hapax ratio) drift monotonically with depth, while **shape features** (entropy_max, tail_decay) remain near-stationary. This is consistent with recursive generation inducing a **location shift** in the NLL distribution while approximately preserving distributional shape. The contribution is: (a) the **task formulation** (generation depth classification beyond binary detection), (b) **empirical validation** across 8 generators / 5 model families (Pythia, OLMo, Qwen, Llama, Mistral; 0.6B–8B) showing DDR is robust, (c) a lightweight 7-feature ensemble achieving leak-free binary F1 = 0.694 under 8-gen LOGO. Depth signal degrades substantially under instruction tuning, restricting current scope to base models.\n\n## Core Claims (3 条，均可证伪)\n\n**Claim 1 — Depth Discriminability**: A 7-feature distributional ensemble can classify generation depth (gen-0 / gen-1 / gen-2+) with leak-free binary F1 = 0.694 (95% CI [0.688, 0.700]) under 8-generator LOGO evaluation, generalizing across unseen generators and model families (LOFO binary F1 = 0.686). Cross-model chains yield binary F1 = 0.830 under generator-level LOGO (5-gen subset). Primary metric is leak-free binary F1 (gen-1 vs gen-2+), excluding gen-0 to avoid seed-sharing leakage.\n\n**Claim 2 — Differential Depth Response & Feature Complementarity**: Features exhibit DDR: drifting features show |ρ| > 0.60 (hapax −0.63, TTR −0.61, entropy_mean −0.60), while shape features show |ρ| < 0.10 (tail_decay 0.04). KS statistics confirm: drifting 0.516–0.537 vs shape 0.043–0.052 (~10× gap). Full 7-feature set (10-fold CV F1 = 0.773) outperforms surface-only (0.688) and reference-only (0.713; McNemar p ≈ 0). Reference-only yields higher binary F1 (0.833 vs 0.695) but surface features are essential for 3-class gen-0 discrimination.\n\n**Claim 3 — Downstream Utility (Negative Finding)**: Depth-aware data curation does NOT improve downstream CLM quality. At equal sample count (n=3,951): random subsampling (ppl=2.367) outperforms depth 0–1 (2.387) and binary-filtered (2.389). TOST confirms equivalence at ±2% margin (p = 1.1×10⁻⁴). Full dataset (n=12,299, ppl=2.335) vs depth-filtered requires ±3% margin for equivalence. Depth fingerprinting is a **diagnostic** tool for provenance characterization, not a **curative** tool for data selection.\n\n## Headline Metrics Summary\n\n| Metric | Value | Context |\n|--------|-------|---------|\n| **Primary: LOGO binary F1** | **0.694** [0.688, 0.700] | 8-gen LOGO, gen-1 vs gen-2+, leak-free |\n| LOGO 3-class F1 | 0.762 [0.758, 0.766] | Inflated by gen-0 seed sharing |\n| Cross-model binary F1 | 0.830 | 5-gen subset, generator-level LOGO |\n| Cross-model 3-class F1 | 0.789 | 5-gen subset, generator-level LOGO |\n| LOFO binary F1 | 0.686 | Leave-one-family-out |\n| Per-gen binary F1 range | 0.633–0.724 | Mistral-7B lowest, Pythia-2.8B highest |\n| 9-gen LOGO 3-class F1 | 0.751 | +Gemma-2-2B; Gemma gen-1 F1=0.036 anomaly |\n| DDR causality | 6/7 Granger sig, 5.5× perm imp gap | Drifting dominance confirmed |\n| Feature ablation (10-fold CV) | Full 0.773, Surface 0.688, Ref 0.713 | McNemar p ≈ 0 |\n| Length-matched binary F1 | 0.724 vs 0.770 unmatched | Deconfounding, not sample-size effect |\n\n## Scope & Limitations (必须在论文中突出)\n\n1. **Base models only**: Instruct-tuned models show substantially degraded signal (OLMo-Instruct LOGO F1 = 0.338 vs 0.763 base). Alignment-imposed length regulation and format constraints compress the distributional variation DDR exploits. This is the **primary scope limitation**.\n2. **Temperature sensitivity**: Reliable within t ∈ [0.5, 0.9] (≤1 pp degradation from default t=0.7). At t = 1.0: −6 pp degradation; entropy_mean ρ drops from −0.60 to −0.002. Cross-temperature transfer degrades severely (t=0.7 → t=1.0: Qwen3-1.7B F1 drops 0.789 → 0.418).\n3. **7-feature ensemble is not optimal**: Multi-detector ensembles (4-det + surface) achieve 3-class 0.795 vs 0.774 (+2.1 pp) and binary 0.708 vs 0.705 (+0.3 pp), but at 2.4× inference cost and 3.2× GPU memory. 7-feature positioned on **efficiency advantage**, not absolute performance.\n4. **3-class resolution ceiling**: 5-class F1 drops to ~0.50; ordinal methods (CORAL, Frank-Hall) yield no improvement over standard XGBoost. Gen-1/gen-2+ boundary is the bottleneck (concentrates 86% of binary errors as FNs).\n5. **Scale effect**: Larger generators show moderate degradation (Mistral-7B: 0.633, Qwen3-8B: 0.692 vs average 0.694). Higher-capacity models compress feature margins.\n6. **Prompt-type dependence**: Continuation chains show stronger drift (F1 = 0.781) than elaboration (0.730).\n\n## Story Spine\n\n**Problem**: Web-scraped training data increasingly contains LLM-generated text of unknown provenance depth (7–17% of recent scientific papers). Current detection methods offer only binary real-vs-synthetic classification, conflating qualitatively different material: gen-1 retains much of the source distribution's lexical properties, while deeper text exhibits measurably reduced vocabulary diversity and compressed perplexity.\n\n**Existing approaches & gaps**: Binary detectors (FastDetectGPT, Binoculars, LD-Score) cannot distinguish gen-1 from gen-2+. Attractor cycle theory (ACL 2025) bounds paraphrasing chains to ~3 classes but depends on semantic-preservation constraints. No existing method addresses generation depth estimation in non-paraphrastic continuation chains. When repurposed as ordinal depth predictors, single detector scores show moderate signal but high cross-generator variance.\n\n**Our framing**: We formulate generation depth classification (gen-0/gen-1/gen-2+) and characterize DDR across 8 base-model generators from 5 families (0.6B–8B). Central-tendency features drift monotonically while shape features remain near-stationary, consistent with recursive generation inducing a location shift in the NLL distribution. A 7-feature ensemble achieves leak-free binary F1 = 0.694 under 8-gen LOGO with a single 410M reference model. Multi-detector ensembles achieve marginally higher F1 at 2.4× cost. The signal degrades under instruction tuning and high temperature, restricting current scope to base models at moderate temperatures.\n\n**Headline result template**: \"On 8 base-model generators from 5 families (0.6B–8B), our 7-feature ensemble achieves leak-free binary F1 = 0.694 under LOGO evaluation and 0.830 on cross-model chains, using a single 410M reference model. Depth-aware curation is statistically equivalent to random subsampling for downstream CLM quality (TOST p = 1.1×10⁻⁴ at ±2% margin), establishing depth fingerprinting as a diagnostic tool for provenance characterization.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n**RC1 — \"Is this just vocabulary impoverishment?\"**: Surface features alone achieve 0.688, but full features achieve 0.773 (McNemar p ≈ 0). Reference features capture different, complementary signal. Reference-only yields higher binary F1 (0.833) but misses gen-0 discrimination. The complementarity itself is a finding.\n\n**RC2 — \"Does this generalize beyond Pythia?\"**: 8 generators from 5 families (Pythia, OLMo, Qwen, Llama, Mistral). LOFO binary F1 = 0.686 confirms cross-family transfer. Cross-model chains (heterogeneous generators per depth step) yield binary F1 = 0.764.\n\n**RC3 — \"Is 3-class sufficient?\"**: 5-class F1 drops to ~0.50. Ordinal methods (CORAL, Frank-Hall) yield no improvement. Gen-1/gen-2+ boundary is the resolution bottleneck. 3 classes represent practical ceiling.\n\n**RC4 — \"How realistic are single-model chains?\"**: Cross-model chains (different generator per step) are evaluated and yield higher F1 (0.764 binary), suggesting generator heterogeneity amplifies distributional shifts.\n\n**RC5 — \"What about human editing?\"**: Robustness test with simulated human edits (random word replacement + LLM-simulated editing). Reported in appendix.\n\n**RC6 — \"Ecological validity?\"**: Multi-domain seeds (news, Wikipedia, scientific, creative) + multiple prompt types (continuation, elaboration, rewriting). Prompt-type dependence reported transparently (continuation 0.781 vs elaboration 0.730).\n\n**RC8 — \"Aren't these just OOD detection features?\"**: Contribution is NOT the features but: (a) ordinal depth estimation formulation, (b) empirical DDR discovery (drifting vs stationary), (c) Findings-level empirical characterization. Paper explicitly connects to OOD/perplexity-based detection literature.\n\n**RC9 — \"Only base models — what about instruct?\"**: Acknowledged as primary limitation. OLMo-Instruct LOGO F1 = 0.338 vs 0.763 base. Instruction tuning compresses the distributional variation DDR exploits. Reported transparently; defines scope boundary.\n\n**RC10 — \"Text length confound\"**: Length-matched subsampling: binary F1 = 0.724 (vs 0.770 unmatched). Random-subsample control confirms drop reflects deconfounding, not sample-size reduction.\n\n**RC11 — \"Downstream — limited evidence\"**: Three seeds, single perplexity metric. TOST equivalence confirmed at ±2% margin for equal-count comparison. Margin sensitivity analysis across ±1%–5% reported. Cohen's d inflated by low seed-level variance; TOST is the appropriate test.\n\n## Contribution Positioning (Findings Level)\nThe contribution is **empirical and conceptual**, appropriate for Findings:\n1. **Problem formulation**: Generation depth classification as a new task beyond binary detection (no prior work addresses this in non-paraphrastic chains)\n2. **Empirical characterization**: DDR across 8 generators / 5 families (0.6B–8B), with cross-generator generalization (LOGO binary F1 = 0.694, LOFO 0.686, cross-model 0.764). Honest reporting of scope boundaries (instruct degradation, temperature sensitivity, scale effect).\n3. **Negative finding**: Depth-aware curation ≡ random subsampling for downstream quality (TOST confirmed). Depth fingerprinting is diagnostic, not curative.\n\n**Framing discipline:**\n- Do NOT call the drift/stationarity split a \"discovery\" — it follows from location-shift properties of the NLL distribution. Acknowledge explicitly.\n- Do NOT use H1/H2 terminology. Use \"drifting\" vs \"stationary\" or \"differential response.\"\n- Do NOT overclaim \"dual dynamics.\" Use \"differential depth response\" (DDR).\n- Report **realistic performance range** (binary F1 0.633–0.724 per-generator, 0.694 LOGO average) in abstract/conclusion, not best-case.\n- Primary metric is leak-free binary F1 (not 3-class, which is inflated by gen-0 seed sharing).\n- 7-feature ensemble is positioned on efficiency, not absolute superiority over multi-detector ensembles.\n\nRelated work must cover: perplexity-based detection (DetectGPT, GLTR, DNA-GPT, Binoculars), model collapse theory, OOD detection, data quality scoring, watermarking, vocabulary diversity, stylometry/authorship attribution, iterative generation (LLM as Broken Telephone ACL 2025), membership inference.\n\n## Venue Fit\n- EMNLP 2026 Findings: Excellent fit — directly addresses data contamination, synthetic data feedback loops, data governance. Empirical/conceptual contribution with honest scope boundaries. Findings-appropriate ambition level: novel task formulation + solid characterization, not a state-of-the-art methodology claim.\n","numLines":93,"startLine":1,"totalLines":93}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y9JLQky3h8agbzCku6XhYg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"feature_ablation_and_trend\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"三部分分析：(A) Feature ablation — full vs reference-only vs surface-only； (B) DDR trend analysis — 每个 feature 的 depth-wise 趋势 + Spearman ρ； (C) Perplexity pre-validation for Claim 3\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"full_macro_f1\": 0.82,\n7\t      \"reference_only_f1\": 0.719,\n8\t      \"surface_only_f1\": 0.763,\n9\t      \"ref_vs_surf_bootstrap_ci\": \"[0.706, 0.733] vs [0.747, 0.774]\",\n10\t      \"drifting_features\": \"entropy_mean (ρ≈−0.60), TTR (ρ≈−0.61), hapax_ratio (ρ≈−0.63)\",\n11\t      \"stationary_features\": \"tail_decay (ρ≈0.04), entropy_std (ρ≈−0.12), entropy_max (ρ≈0.05)\",\n12\t      \"median_ppl_by_depth\": \"13.50 → 4.96 → 3.00 → 2.07 → 1.72\",\n13\t      \"ppl_depth_monotonic\": true\n14\t    },\n15\t    \"tables\": [\n16\t      {\n17\t        \"caption\": \"Table 2: Feature ablation results (5-fold CV, Pythia-2.8B)\",\n18\t        \"columns\": [\n19\t          \"Feature Set\",\n20\t          \"N Features\",\n21\t          \"Macro F1\",\n22\t          \"95% CI\"\n23\t        ],\n24\t        \"rows\": [\n25\t          [\n26\t            \"Full\",\n27\t            7,\n28\t            0.82,\n29\t            \"[0.807, 0.833]\"\n30\t          ],\n31\t          [\n32\t            \"Surface-only\",\n33\t            2,\n34\t            0.763,\n35\t            \"[0.747, 0.774]\"\n36\t          ],\n37\t          [\n38\t            \"Reference-only\",\n39\t            5,\n40\t            0.719,\n41\t            \"[0.706, 0.733]\"\n42\t          ]\n43\t        ]\n44\t      },\n45\t      {\n46\t        \"caption\": \"Table 3: Feature-depth Spearman correlations\",\n47\t        \"columns\": [\n48\t          \"Feature\",\n49\t          \"ρ\",\n50\t          \"Category\",\n51\t          \"Trend\"\n52\t        ],\n53\t        \"rows\": [\n54\t          [\n55\t            \"hapax_ratio\",\n56\t            \"−0.63\",\n57\t            \"Drifting\",\n58\t            \"Monotonic decrease\"\n59\t          ],\n60\t          [\n61\t            \"TTR\",\n62\t            \"−0.61\",\n63\t            \"Drifting\",\n64\t            \"Monotonic decrease\"\n65\t          ],\n66\t          [\n67\t            \"entropy_mean\",\n68\t            \"−0.60\",\n69\t            \"Drifting\",\n70\t            \"Monotonic decrease\"\n71\t          ],\n72\t          [\n73\t            \"entropy_min\",\n74\t            \"−0.39\",\n75\t            \"Intermediate\",\n76\t            \"Moderate decrease\"\n77\t          ],\n78\t          [\n79\t            \"entropy_std\",\n80\t            \"−0.12\",\n81\t            \"Stationary\",\n82\t            \"Near-flat\"\n83\t          ],\n84\t          [\n85\t            \"entropy_max\",\n86\t            0.05,\n87\t            \"Stationary\",\n88\t            \"Near-flat\"\n89\t          ],\n90\t          [\n91\t            \"tail_decay\",\n92\t            0.04,\n93\t            \"Stationary\",\n94\t            \"Near-flat\"\n95\t          ]\n96\t        ]\n97\t      }\n98\t    ],\n99\t    \"figures\": [],\n100\t    \"analysis\": \"Full > Surface > Reference 的排序表明 surface 特征（TTR, hapax）捕获了最强的单维信号， 但 reference 特征提供了不可替代的互补信息。Surface-only 虽然绝对值更高，但 reference-only 在 binary task（gen-1 vs gen-2+）上表现更优（binary F1=0.833 vs 0.695），这是因为 reference 特征在排除 gen-0 后捕获了更 fine-grained 的 NLL 分布位移。 DDR 分离的物理解释：递归生成诱导 NLL 分布的 location shift，central-tendency 指标（mean, TTR, hapax）跟踪这一 shift 因而漂移，shape 指标（max, tail_decay）反映分布形态因而稳定。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，full 7-feature 以 0.820 显著高于两个 subset（McNemar p≈0）， surface-only 以 0.763 高于 reference-only 0.719，但两者都显著低于 full， 证明互补性而非冗余性。审稿人接受这一 4.4 pp gap 作为 complementarity 证据。 DDR 趋势清晰：drifting 三特征 |ρ|>0.60 呈单调下降，shape 特征 |ρ|<0.12 近乎水平。Perplexity 随 depth 单调下降（13.50→1.72）预验证 Claim 3 信号存在。 这组结果为后续所有实验奠定特征空间基础。\\n\"\n101\t  },\n102\t  {\n103\t    \"name\": \"cross_generator_evaluation\",\n104\t    \"description\": \"扩展至 5 generators（Pythia-2.8B, Pythia-1B, OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-1.7B, Qwen3-0.6B）， LOGO 交叉验证评估跨生成器泛化性\\n\",\n105\t    \"results\": {\n106\t      \"total_records\": 18423,\n107\t      \"generators\": 5,\n108\t      \"logo_avg_macro_f1\": 0.804,\n109\t      \"logo_best_held_out\": {\n110\t        \"model\": \"pythia-1b\",\n111\t        \"f1\": 0.851\n112\t      },\n113\t      \"logo_worst_held_out\": {\n114\t        \"model\": \"olmo-2-1b\",\n115\t        \"f1\": 0.752\n116\t      },\n117\t      \"lofo_delta\": 0.011,\n118\t      \"ablation_full_f1\": 0.804,\n119\t      \"ablation_reference_only_f1\": 0.754,\n120\t      \"ablation_surface_only_f1\": 0.747,\n121\t      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.0,\n122\t      \"top3_features\": [\n123\t        \"hapax_ratio (0.289)\",\n124\t        \"ttr (0.168)\",\n125\t        \"entropy_mean (0.160)\"\n126\t      ]\n127\t    },\n128\t    \"tables\": [\n129\t      {\n130\t        \"caption\": \"Table 4: LOGO cross-generator evaluation\",\n131\t        \"columns\": [\n132\t          \"Held-out Generator\",\n133\t          \"Macro F1\",\n134\t          \"Binary F1\",\n135\t          \"Gen-1 F1\"\n136\t        ],\n137\t        \"rows\": [\n138\t          [\n139\t            \"Pythia-1B\",\n140\t            0.851,\n141\t            0.724,\n142\t            0.689\n143\t          ],\n144\t          [\n145\t            \"Qwen3-0.6B\",\n146\t            0.824,\n147\t            0.71,\n148\t            0.652\n149\t          ],\n150\t          [\n151\t            \"Qwen3-1.7B\",\n152\t            0.805,\n153\t            0.698,\n154\t            0.641\n155\t          ],\n156\t          [\n157\t            \"Pythia-2.8B\",\n158\t            0.804,\n159\t            0.694,\n160\t            0.638\n161\t          ],\n162\t          [\n163\t            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n164\t            0.752,\n165\t            0.663,\n166\t            0.585\n167\t          ],\n168\t          [\n169\t            \"Average\",\n170\t            0.804,\n171\t            0.694,\n172\t            0.641\n173\t          ]\n174\t        ]\n175\t      }\n176\t    ],\n177\t    \"figures\": [],\n178\t    \"analysis\": \"5-gen LOGO 为后续 8-gen/9-gen 扩展奠定基线。OLMo 的相对弱势来自其 tokenizer 和 训练数据分布与 Pythia/Qwen 的差异——这本身验证了 DDR 在不同预训练配方下的鲁棒性（仍 >0.75）。 LOFO delta 仅 0.011 说明 Pythia 家族重叠未严重膨胀 LOGO 指标。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，5-gen LOGO 均值 0.804 显示强跨生成器泛化。Pythia-1B held-out 最高（0.851） 因为 Pythia-2.8B 在训练集中提供了同家族信号；OLMo held-out 最低（0.752）因为 OLMo 的生成分布与 Pythia/Qwen 家族差异最大。Family-out delta 仅 0.011 pp，审稿人接受为 cross-family generalization 证据。Feature importance 排序（hapax > ttr > entropy_mean） 与 plan_001 一致，确认 surface drifting 特征是主驱动力，但 McNemar p≈0 证明 reference 特征对 full 集的贡献统计显著。\\n\"\n179\t  },\n180\t  {\n181\t    \"name\": \"cross_family_reference_model\",\n182\t    \"description\": \"测试非 Pythia reference model（OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-0.6B）提取特征， 验证 DDR 是否为 generation-intrinsic 而非 reference-model artifact\\n\",\n183\t    \"results\": {\n184\t      \"logo_f1_pythia_ref\": 0.803,\n185\t      \"logo_f1_olmo_ref\": 0.807,\n186\t      \"logo_f1_qwen_ref\": 0.816,\n187\t      \"entropy_drift_all_refs_negative\": true,\n188\t      \"pythia_ref_drift_range\": \"[−1.19, −1.40]\",\n189\t      \"olmo_ref_drift_range\": \"[−0.61, −0.91]\",\n190\t      \"qwen_ref_drift_range\": \"[−0.96, −1.35]\",\n191\t      \"dual_dynamics_is_pythia_artifact\": false\n192\t    },\n193\t    \"tables\": [\n194\t      {\n195\t        \"caption\": \"Table 5: Cross-reference-model DDR validation\",\n196\t        \"columns\": [\n197\t          \"Reference Model\",\n198\t          \"LOGO F1\",\n199\t          \"entropy_mean drift range\",\n200\t          \"DDR preserved\"\n201\t        ],\n202\t        \"rows\": [\n203\t          [\n204\t            \"Pythia-410M (default)\",\n205\t            0.803,\n206\t            \"[−1.19, −1.40]\",\n207\t            \"✓\"\n208\t          ],\n209\t          [\n210\t            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n211\t            0.807,\n212\t            \"[−0.61, −0.91]\",\n213\t            \"✓\"\n214\t          ],\n215\t          [\n216\t            \"Qwen3-0.6B\",\n217\t            0.816,\n218\t            \"[−0.96, −1.35]\",\n219\t            \"✓\"\n220\t          ]\n221\t        ]\n222\t      }\n223\t    ],\n224\t    \"figures\": [],\n225\t    \"analysis\": \"漂移幅度的差异（Pythia > Qwen > OLMo）反映了 reference model 自身 perplexity scale 的差异， 但方向一致性是关键。这排除了 \\\"DDR 只是 Pythia tokenizer 的 artifact\\\" 这一最致命的替代解释。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，三个 reference model 均产生负向 entropy drift（所有 range 为负）， LOGO F1 跨 reference 差异 <1.5 pp（0.803–0.816），关键性地证明 DDR 是 generation-intrinsic 现象而非 Pythia-410M 特有 artifact。Qwen reference 略优 可能因其 tokenizer 粒度更细，捕获了更丰富的 NLL 分布信息。这是 Claim 2 的核心 falsification test 通过：如果 DDR 消失于非 Pythia reference，整个 dual dynamics 叙事将崩塌。审稿人在 best 档下接受这一 3-reference 交叉验证为充分证据。\\n\"\n226\t  },\n227\t  {\n228\t    \"name\": \"downstream_utility\",\n229\t    \"description\": \"OLMo-1B fine-tune on depth-stratified subsets，3 seeds with bootstrap CIs， sample-count-matched comparison。验证 Claim 3（negative finding）。\\n\",\n230\t    \"results\": {\n231\t      \"total_runs\": 15,\n232\t      \"variants\": {\n233\t        \"all\": {\n234\t          \"ppl_mean\": 2.335,\n235\t          \"ppl_std\": 0.0003\n236\t        },\n237\t        \"size_matched\": {\n238\t          \"ppl_mean\": 2.367,\n239\t          \"ppl_std\": 0.0002\n240\t        },\n241\t        \"depth01\": {\n242\t          \"ppl_mean\": 2.387,\n243\t          \"ppl_std\": 0.0005\n244\t        },\n245\t        \"binary_filtered\": {\n246\t          \"ppl_mean\": 2.389,\n247\t          \"ppl_std\": 0.0004\n248\t        },\n249\t        \"depth0_only\": {\n250\t          \"ppl_mean\": 2.681,\n251\t          \"ppl_std\": 0.0012\n252\t        }\n253\t      },\n254\t      \"ranking\": \"all(2.335) < size_matched(2.367) < depth01(2.387) ≈ binary_filtered(2.389) << depth0_only(2.681)\",\n255\t      \"tost_equivalence_p\": 0.00011,\n256\t      \"tost_margin\": \"±2%\",\n257\t      \"seed_variance\": \"<0.002 ppl across seeds within same variant\",\n258\t      \"cohens_d_sizeMatched_vs_depth01\": \"inflated by low variance\"\n259\t    },\n260\t    \"tables\": [\n261\t      {\n262\t        \"caption\": \"Table 7: Downstream CLM perplexity by training data composition (3 seeds)\",\n263\t        \"columns\": [\n264\t          \"Variant\",\n265\t          \"N train\",\n266\t          \"Ppl (mean±std)\",\n267\t          \"Δ vs size_matched\"\n268\t        ],\n269\t        \"rows\": [\n270\t          [\n271\t            \"All data\",\n272\t            12299,\n273\t            \"2.335 ± 0.0003\",\n274\t            \"−0.032\"\n275\t          ],\n276\t          [\n277\t            \"Size-matched random\",\n278\t            3951,\n279\t            \"2.367 ± 0.0002\",\n280\t            \"— (baseline)\"\n281\t          ],\n282\t          [\n283\t            \"Depth 0+1 only\",\n284\t            3951,\n285\t            \"2.387 ± 0.0005\",\n286\t            0.02\n287\t          ],\n288\t          [\n289\t            \"Binary-filtered\",\n290\t            3951,\n291\t            \"2.389 ± 0.0004\",\n292\t            0.022\n293\t          ],\n294\t          [\n295\t            \"Depth 0 only\",\n296\t            797,\n297\t            \"2.681 ± 0.0012\",\n298\t            0.314\n299\t          ]\n300\t        ]\n301\t      }\n302\t    ],\n303\t    \"figures\": [],\n304\t    \"analysis\": \"Negative finding 的关键价值在于终止了一个看似合理但无效的研究方向：既然 depth 信息存在且可检测， 自然会假设可用于数据筛选。实验证明这一假设不成立。More data > better data 在 3951 samples 的低数据量下尤为明显。TOST equivalence 而非 NHST 是正确的统计框架选择。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，negative finding 清晰：depth-aware filtering 不优于 random subsampling（size_matched 2.367 vs depth01 2.387，差 0.020 ppl）。TOST 在 ±2% margin 下 p=1.1×10⁻⁴ 确认统计等价。 depth0_only 的显著劣势（2.681）是预期的——纯人类文本量太少（797 samples）。关键是 size_matched vs depth01 的差异方向反直觉：random subsample 比 depth-curated 还好 0.020 ppl， 说明 depth 信息对下游 CLM 质量无 curative 价值。审稿人在 best 档下将此认可为 \\\"valuable honest science\\\" 而非 \\\"method doesn't work\\\"——论文诚实地将 depth fingerprinting 定位为 diagnostic tool（provenance characterization）而非 curative tool（data selection）。 三 seed 极低方差（<0.002）既增强结论可靠性，也意味着 Cohen's d 被人为放大，论文正确选择 TOST 而非 effect size 作为主检验。\\n\"\n305\t  },\n306\t  {\n307\t    \"name\": \"prompt_type_comparison\",\n308\t    \"description\": \"比较 continuation / elaboration / inspired_rewriting 三种 prompt type 的 depth signal\\n\",\n309\t    \"results\": {\n310\t      \"cv_f1\": {\n311\t        \"continuation\": 0.781,\n312\t        \"inspired_rewriting\": 0.737,\n313\t        \"elaboration\": 0.73\n314\t      },\n315\t      \"lopto_f1\": {\n316\t        \"held_out_continuation\": 0.762,\n317\t        \"held_out_elaboration\": 0.762,\n318\t        \"held_out_rewriting\": 0.733,\n319\t        \"average\": 0.753\n320\t      },\n321\t      \"depth_retention_d4_d0\": {\n322\t        \"continuation\": 0.831,\n323\t        \"inspired_rewriting\": 0.939,\n324\t        \"elaboration\": 0.986\n325\t      },\n326\t      \"drift_hapax\": {\n327\t        \"continuation\": \"−0.74\",\n328\t        \"elaboration\": \"−0.83\",\n329\t        \"rewriting\": \"−0.80\"\n330\t      },\n331\t      \"drift_ttr\": {\n332\t        \"continuation\": \"−0.607\",\n333\t        \"elaboration\": \"−0.641\",\n334\t        \"rewriting\": \"−0.618\"\n335\t      }\n336\t    },\n337\t    \"tables\": [\n338\t      {\n339\t        \"caption\": \"Table 8: Prompt-type comparison (Pythia-2.8B)\",\n340\t        \"columns\": [\n341\t          \"Prompt Type\",\n342\t          \"CV F1\",\n343\t          \"LOPTO F1\",\n344\t          \"Depth Retention\",\n345\t          \"hapax ρ\"\n346\t        ],\n347\t        \"rows\": [\n348\t          [\n349\t            \"Continuation\",\n350\t            0.781,\n351\t            0.762,\n352\t            0.831,\n353\t            \"−0.74\"\n354\t          ],\n355\t          [\n356\t            \"Inspired rewriting\",\n357\t            0.737,\n358\t            0.733,\n359\t            0.939,\n360\t            \"−0.80\"\n361\t          ],\n362\t          [\n363\t            \"Elaboration\",\n364\t            0.73,\n365\t            0.762,\n366\t            0.986,\n367\t            \"−0.83\"\n368\t          ]\n369\t        ]\n370\t      }\n371\t    ],\n372\t    \"figures\": [],\n373\t    \"analysis\": \"Prompt-type 差异本身是有趣发现：语义约束越强（elaboration > rewriting > continuation）， chain 越稳定但 depth discriminability 越低。这与 DDR 的 location-shift 解释一致—— 约束越强，模型输出分布被锚定在更窄的范围内，location shift 幅度减小。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，三种 prompt type 均保留 DDR 信号但强度不同。Continuation 的 within-type CV F1 最高（0.781）但 depth retention 最低（83.1%），因为 continuation 给予模型最大自由度， 导致更多 chain dropout 但也产生更强的 distributional shift。Elaboration retention 最高 （98.6%）但 CV F1 最低（0.730），因为 elaboration 约束模型围绕原文展开，压缩了 cross-depth 变异。Rewriting 居中。Leave-one-prompt-type-out 交叉验证（avg 0.753） 低于 within-type（avg 0.749）仅 ~0.4 pp，表明 prompt type 间的 DDR 信号高度可迁移。 审稿人接受 prompt-type dependence 的透明报告为 ecological validity 证据。\\n\"\n374\t  },\n375\t  {\n376\t    \"name\": \"paraphrastic_comparison\",\n377\t    \"description\": \"构建平行 paraphrasing chains 与 continuation chains 直接比较， 测试 attractor convergence theory\\n\",\n378\t    \"results\": {\n379\t      \"paraphrase_cv_f1\": 0.62,\n380\t      \"continuation_cv_f1\": 0.781,\n381\t      \"paraphrase_depth_retention\": 0.97,\n382\t      \"paraphrase_hapax_rho\": \"−0.25\",\n383\t      \"paraphrase_entropy_mean_rho\": \"−0.18\",\n384\t      \"attractor_convergence_depth\": 2,\n385\t      \"delta_cv_f1\": \"−0.161\"\n386\t    },\n387\t    \"tables\": [\n388\t      {\n389\t        \"caption\": \"Table 9: Paraphrastic vs non-paraphrastic chains\",\n390\t        \"columns\": [\n391\t          \"Chain Type\",\n392\t          \"CV F1\",\n393\t          \"hapax ρ\",\n394\t          \"entropy_mean ρ\",\n395\t          \"Retention d4/d0\"\n396\t        ],\n397\t        \"rows\": [\n398\t          [\n399\t            \"Continuation\",\n400\t            0.781,\n401\t            \"−0.74\",\n402\t            \"−0.56\",\n403\t            0.831\n404\t          ],\n405\t          [\n406\t            \"Paraphrasing\",\n407\t            0.62,\n408\t            \"−0.25\",\n409\t            \"−0.18\",\n410\t            0.97\n411\t          ],\n412\t          [\n413\t            \"Δ\",\n414\t            \"−0.161\",\n415\t            0.49,\n416\t            0.38,\n417\t            0.139\n418\t          ]\n419\t        ]\n420\t      }\n421\t    ],\n422\t    \"figures\": [],\n423\t    \"analysis\": \"这是论文与 ACL 2025 attractor cycle 理论的关键联系点。Non-paraphrastic chains 不受 semantic-preservation attractor 约束，因此 distributional drift 可以持续到更深层， 为 depth estimation 提供更丰富的信号空间。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，paraphrasing chains 的 depth signal 显著弱于 continuation（CV F1 0.62 vs 0.781，−16.1 pp）。Paraphrasing 由于语义保持约束，每步输出被 attractor basin 拉回， depth 间差异在 depth 2 后趋于收敛（与 ACL 2025 \\\"LLM as Broken Telephone\\\" 的 ~3 class ceiling 一致）。DDR drifting 特征在 paraphrase 中 ρ 幅度大幅缩小（hapax −0.25 vs −0.63）， 因为 paraphrase 保持语义→保持词汇多样性→TTR/hapax drift 被抑制。这验证了论文核心定位： DDR 是 non-paraphrastic chain 特有的现象，paraphrastic chain 走向 attractor convergence。 审稿人在 best 档下接受这一对比作为 task formulation 的 motivation——深度估计在 continuation/elaboration chain 中才有 meaningful signal。\\n\"\n424\t  },\n425\t  {\n426\t    \"name\": \"cross_model_chains\",\n427\t    \"description\": \"Cross-model chains（每步使用不同 generator）vs single-model chains， 模拟真实 web contamination 场景\\n\",\n428\t    \"results\": {\n429\t      \"cross_model_binary_f1\": 0.83,\n430\t      \"cross_model_3class_f1\": 0.789,\n431\t      \"single_model_binary_f1\": 0.694,\n432\t      \"single_model_3class_f1\": 0.762,\n433\t      \"cross_model_logo_binary\": 0.83,\n434\t      \"delta_binary_vs_single\": 0.136,\n435\t      \"n_generators_in_cross\": 5\n436\t    },\n437\t    \"tables\": [\n438\t      {\n439\t        \"caption\": \"Table 6: Cross-model vs single-model chain evaluation\",\n440\t        \"columns\": [\n441\t          \"Setting\",\n442\t          \"Binary F1\",\n443\t          \"3-class F1\",\n444\t          \"N Generators\"\n445\t        ],\n446\t        \"rows\": [\n447\t          [\n448\t            \"Single-model LOGO\",\n449\t            0.694,\n450\t            0.762,\n451\t            \"8 (homogeneous)\"\n452\t          ],\n453\t          [\n454\t            \"Cross-model LOGO\",\n455\t            0.83,\n456\t            0.789,\n457\t            \"5 (heterogeneous)\"\n458\t          ],\n459\t          [\n460\t            \"Δ\",\n461\t            0.136,\n462\t            0.027,\n463\t            \"—\"\n464\t          ]\n465\t        ]\n466\t      }\n467\t    ],\n468\t    \"figures\": [],\n469\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-model 的优势来自 generator heterogeneity amplifying distributional shifts。 在单模型 chain 中，depth-wise drift 是同一模型 bias 的累积；在 cross-model chain 中， 每步引入新模型 bias，产生更大的 inter-depth 特征差异。这是 ecological validity 的 正面证据：真实世界的 contamination 更可能涉及多个 generator。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，cross-model chains 的 binary F1 0.830 显著高于 single-model 0.694 （+13.6 pp），这一 counterintuitive 结果的原因是：不同 generator 在每步引入额外的 distributional discontinuity（不同 tokenizer bias, 不同 perplexity scale）， 放大了 depth 间的特征差异。这对审稿人而言是 strength——说明在更 realistic 的 heterogeneous contamination 场景下，depth signal 反而更强。0.830 cross-model binary F1 被 highlight 为 generalization evidence，审稿人接受 5-gen subset LOGO 作为评估方法。 3-class F1 同样提升（0.789 vs 0.762），但提升幅度小于 binary，因为 gen-0 identification 的 seed-sharing advantage 在两种设定下相当。\\n\"\n470\t  },\n471\t  {\n472\t    \"name\": \"multi_domain_seeds\",\n473\t    \"description\": \"扩展至 4 domains（Wikipedia, news, scientific, creative/code）， 500 seeds/domain × 5 depths\\n\",\n474\t    \"results\": {\n475\t      \"news_binary_f1\": 0.746,\n476\t      \"news_binary_ci\": [\n477\t        0.726,\n478\t        0.764\n479\t      ],\n480\t      \"academic_binary_f1\": 0.739,\n481\t      \"academic_binary_ci\": [\n482\t        0.72,\n483\t        0.757\n484\t      ],\n485\t      \"code_binary_f1\": 0.754,\n486\t      \"code_binary_ci\": [\n487\t        0.737,\n488\t        0.77\n489\t      ],\n490\t      \"wikipedia_baseline_binary_f1\": 0.815,\n491\t      \"max_gap_vs_wiki_pp\": 7.62,\n492\t      \"worst_domain\": \"academic\",\n493\t      \"best_domain\": \"code\",\n494\t      \"conclusion_label\": \"domain_independent\"\n495\t    },\n496\t    \"tables\": [\n497\t      {\n498\t        \"caption\": \"Table 10: Multi-domain evaluation\",\n499\t        \"columns\": [\n500\t          \"Domain\",\n501\t          \"Binary F1\",\n502\t          \"95% CI\",\n503\t          \"3-class F1\"\n504\t        ],\n505\t        \"rows\": [\n506\t          [\n507\t            \"Wikipedia (baseline)\",\n508\t            0.815,\n509\t            \"[0.799, 0.831]\",\n510\t            0.863\n511\t          ],\n512\t          [\n513\t            \"Code\",\n514\t            0.754,\n515\t            \"[0.737, 0.770]\",\n516\t            0.634\n517\t          ],\n518\t          [\n519\t            \"News\",\n520\t            0.746,\n521\t            \"[0.726, 0.764]\",\n522\t            0.652\n523\t          ],\n524\t          [\n525\t            \"Academic\",\n526\t            0.739,\n527\t            \"[0.720, 0.757]\",\n528\t            0.622\n529\t          ]\n530\t        ]\n531\t      }\n532\t    ],\n533\t    \"figures\": [],\n534\t    \"analysis\": \"Multi-domain 结果直接回应 RC6（ecological validity）。DDR 在 news/academic/code 上的 一致性说明 depth signal 不依赖于特定文本类型的 vocabulary 特征。3-class F1 的 domain 差异更大（0.622–0.863），因为 gen-0 vs gen-1 区分依赖 seed-specific 线索，这在 不同 domain 中差异更大。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，所有 domain 的 binary F1 均在 0.739–0.754 范围内（排除 Wikipedia 基线）， domain 间 max gap 仅 1.5 pp，审稿人接受 DDR 为 domain-independent 现象。Wikipedia 基线（0.815）高出 ~7 pp 是预期的——Wikipedia 种子文本结构化程度更高、长度更稳定， 减少了 confounding variation。Academic domain 最低（0.739）因为学术文本的词汇多样性 本身就高且 depth 间变化小（base model 生成学术文本时更依赖 template phrasing）。 Code domain 意外地最高（0.754），因为 code-like 文本的 entropy 分布更 bimodal， DDR drifting 在 entropy_mean 上更明显。所有 CI 均不包含 0.5（random baseline）， 确认 depth signal 在所有 domain 中统计显著。\\n\"\n535\t  },\n536\t  {\n537\t    \"name\": \"finer_grained_ordinal\",\n538\t    \"description\": \"5-class 序数分类（gen-0 至 gen-4），测试更细粒度 depth resolution 的可行性\\n\",\n539\t    \"results\": {\n540\t      \"five_class_f1\": 0.5,\n541\t      \"three_class_f1_reference\": 0.762,\n542\t      \"ordinal_coral_f1\": 0.49,\n543\t      \"ordinal_frank_hall_f1\": 0.5,\n544\t      \"xgboost_standard_f1\": 0.5,\n545\t      \"bottleneck\": \"gen-1/gen-2 boundary, 86% binary FNs concentrated here\",\n546\t      \"gen3_vs_gen4_f1\": 0.35\n547\t    },\n548\t    \"tables\": [\n549\t      {\n550\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.3: Ordinal classification results\",\n551\t        \"columns\": [\n552\t          \"Method\",\n553\t          \"3-class F1\",\n554\t          \"5-class F1\",\n555\t          \"Δ\"\n556\t        ],\n557\t        \"rows\": [\n558\t          [\n559\t            \"XGBoost (standard)\",\n560\t            0.762,\n561\t            0.5,\n562\t            \"−0.262\"\n563\t          ],\n564\t          [\n565\t            \"CORAL\",\n566\t            0.758,\n567\t            0.49,\n568\t            \"−0.268\"\n569\t          ],\n570\t          [\n571\t            \"Frank-Hall\",\n572\t            0.76,\n573\t            0.5,\n574\t            \"−0.260\"\n575\t          ]\n576\t        ]\n577\t      }\n578\t    ],\n579\t    \"figures\": [],\n580\t    \"analysis\": \"5-class 的 ceiling 与 DDR 的物理解释一致：location shift 在前几步（0→1→2）幅度最大， 之后递减。Gen-3 和 gen-4 的 NLL 分布差异已小于 feature extraction noise floor。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，5-class F1 降至 ~0.50，相比 3-class 的 0.762 大幅下降。Ordinal methods （CORAL, Frank-Hall）未能改善——这说明 depth signal 的 resolution ceiling 在 3 class， 不是分类方法的选择问题而是 feature space 的固有限制。Gen-1/gen-2 boundary 贡献了 86% 的 binary errors（作为 FN），因为 gen-1 和 gen-2 在 feature space 中高度重叠。 Gen-3 vs gen-4 几乎不可分（F1≈0.35）。审稿人在 best 档下接受 3-class 为 practical ceiling，论文诚实报告这一限制为 strength。5-class 负面结果排除了 \\\"只要用更好方法就能 区分更多 depth\\\" 的替代假说。\\n\"\n581\t  },\n582\t  {\n583\t    \"name\": \"human_edit_robustness\",\n584\t    \"description\": \"鲁棒性测试：(A) Random word replacement (5/10/20%)，(B) LLM-simulated editing\\n\",\n585\t    \"results\": {\n586\t      \"baseline_binary_f1\": 0.695,\n587\t      \"random_5pct_f1\": 0.65,\n588\t      \"random_10pct_f1\": 0.614,\n589\t      \"random_20pct_f1\": 0.591,\n590\t      \"llm_rephrase_binary_f1\": 0.647,\n591\t      \"llm_rephrase_multiclass_f1\": 0.667,\n592\t      \"llm_edit_distance_ratio\": 0.507,\n593\t      \"llm_avg_sentences_replaced\": 1.69,\n594\t      \"drop_5pct\": \"−0.046\",\n595\t      \"drop_10pct\": \"−0.081\",\n596\t      \"drop_20pct\": \"−0.104\",\n597\t      \"drop_llm\": \"−0.045\"\n598\t    },\n599\t    \"tables\": [\n600\t      {\n601\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.5: Robustness to text editing\",\n602\t        \"columns\": [\n603\t          \"Condition\",\n604\t          \"Binary F1\",\n605\t          \"Δ vs baseline\"\n606\t        ],\n607\t        \"rows\": [\n608\t          [\n609\t            \"No editing (baseline)\",\n610\t            0.695,\n611\t            \"—\"\n612\t          ],\n613\t          [\n614\t            \"5% random replacement\",\n615\t            0.65,\n616\t            \"−0.046\"\n617\t          ],\n618\t          [\n619\t            \"10% random replacement\",\n620\t            0.614,\n621\t            \"−0.081\"\n622\t          ],\n623\t          [\n624\t            \"20% random replacement\",\n625\t            0.591,\n626\t            \"−0.104\"\n627\t          ],\n628\t          [\n629\t            \"LLM rephrase (avg 1.69 sent)\",\n630\t            0.647,\n631\t            \"−0.045\"\n632\t          ]\n633\t        ]\n634\t      }\n635\t    ],\n636\t    \"figures\": [],\n637\t    \"analysis\": \"LLM rephrase 与 5% random 的 drop 相近这一发现本身有价值：LLM editing 的特征空间扰动 并不比 naive random replacement 更具破坏性，可能因为 LLM editing 保持了文本的局部统计 一致性（不引入 out-of-distribution tokens）。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，depth signal 对 human editing 展现 graceful degradation。5% random noise 仅降 4.6 pp，LLM rephrase（平均替换 1.69 句，编辑距离 50.7%）降 4.5 pp——两者接近， 因为 LLM rephrase 虽然更自然但实际修改幅度（50.7% edit distance）与 5% random 在 feature 空间的扰动量级相当。20% random 的 10.4 pp drop 仍保持 F1>0.59（>random baseline）， 说明 depth signal 不完全依赖逐字保真。审稿人在 best 档下将 graceful degradation 视为 positive——完全抵抗 editing 是不现实的，important 是 degradation curve 平滑且 在 realistic editing level（5–10%）下性能损失可控。LLM rephrase 结果直接回应 RC5。\\n\"\n638\t  },\n639\t  {\n640\t    \"name\": \"ld_score_feature\",\n641\t    \"description\": \"添加 LD-Score（character-level distributional signature）作为额外特征\\n\",\n642\t    \"results\": {\n643\t      \"seven_feature_f1\": 0.798,\n644\t      \"eight_feature_with_ld_f1\": 0.803,\n645\t      \"ld_score_only_f1\": 0.721,\n646\t      \"ld_score_spearman_depth\": \"−0.794\",\n647\t      \"delta_with_ld\": 0.005,\n648\t      \"ld_feature_importance_rank\": 4\n649\t    },\n650\t    \"tables\": [\n651\t      {\n652\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.6: LD-Score augmentation\",\n653\t        \"columns\": [\n654\t          \"Feature Set\",\n655\t          \"LOGO F1\",\n656\t          \"Δ\"\n657\t        ],\n658\t        \"rows\": [\n659\t          [\n660\t            \"7-feature (default)\",\n661\t            0.798,\n662\t            \"—\"\n663\t          ],\n664\t          [\n665\t            \"7-feature + LD-Score\",\n666\t            0.803,\n667\t            0.005\n668\t          ],\n669\t          [\n670\t            \"LD-Score only\",\n671\t            0.721,\n672\t            \"−0.077\"\n673\t          ]\n674\t        ]\n675\t      }\n676\t    ],\n677\t    \"figures\": [],\n678\t    \"analysis\": \"LD-Score 的 marginal contribution 较小（+0.5 pp），确认 7-feature set 已捕获大部分 depth signal。Character-level 信息主要通过 character frequency distribution 的 shift 反映 vocabulary impoverishment，与 TTR/hapax 高度相关。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，LD-Score 作为 character-level 特征与 token-level reference 特征部分互补， 加入后 LOGO F1 提升 0.5 pp（0.798→0.803），统计上显著但 practical 提升有限。 LD-Score 单独的 F1=0.721 介于 surface-only（0.688）和 reference-only（0.713）之间， Spearman ρ=−0.794 表明其与 depth 有强负相关。Feature importance 排第 4（在 hapax, ttr, entropy_mean 之后），说明 LD-Score 捕获的信号与 reference 特征高度 correlated 但非完全冗余。审稿人在 best 档下接受将 LD-Score 作为 supplementary evidence， 论文在 appendix 中报告此结果。7-feature 仍为 primary model 以保持简洁性。\\n\"\n679\t  },\n680\t  {\n681\t    \"name\": \"end_to_end_classifier\",\n682\t    \"description\": \"QLoRA fine-tuned model 进行端到端 depth classification， 比较 learned representations vs handcrafted features\\n\",\n683\t    \"results\": {\n684\t      \"qlora_olmo_instruct_3class_f1\": 0.888,\n685\t      \"qlora_qwen_instruct_3class_f1\": 0.907,\n686\t      \"qlora_olmo_base_3class_f1\": 0.859,\n687\t      \"qlora_qwen_base_3class_f1\": 0.904,\n688\t      \"qlora_olmo_instruct_binary_f1\": 0.836,\n689\t      \"qlora_qwen_instruct_binary_f1\": 0.867,\n690\t      \"qlora_olmo_base_binary_f1\": 0.793,\n691\t      \"qlora_qwen_base_binary_f1\": 0.86,\n692\t      \"qlora_5class_best_f1\": 0.597,\n693\t      \"seven_feature_3class_f1\": 0.762,\n694\t      \"delta_3class\": \"+12.6–14.5 pp\",\n695\t      \"inference_cost_ratio\": \"~15×\"\n696\t    },\n697\t    \"tables\": [\n698\t      {\n699\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.7: End-to-end QLoRA vs 7-feature ensemble\",\n700\t        \"columns\": [\n701\t          \"Model\",\n702\t          \"Type\",\n703\t          \"3-class F1\",\n704\t          \"Binary F1\",\n705\t          \"5-class F1\"\n706\t        ],\n707\t        \"rows\": [\n708\t          [\n709\t            \"Qwen3-1.7B (instruct)\",\n710\t            \"QLoRA\",\n711\t            0.907,\n712\t            0.867,\n713\t            0.551\n714\t          ],\n715\t          [\n716\t            \"OLMo-1B (instruct)\",\n717\t            \"QLoRA\",\n718\t            0.888,\n719\t            0.836,\n720\t            0.598\n721\t          ],\n722\t          [\n723\t            \"Qwen3-1.7B (base)\",\n724\t            \"QLoRA\",\n725\t            0.904,\n726\t            0.86,\n727\t            0.554\n728\t          ],\n729\t          [\n730\t            \"OLMo-1B (base)\",\n731\t            \"QLoRA\",\n732\t            0.859,\n733\t            0.793,\n734\t            0.54\n735\t          ],\n736\t          [\n737\t            \"7-feature ensemble\",\n738\t            \"XGBoost\",\n739\t            0.762,\n740\t            0.694,\n741\t            0.5\n742\t          ]\n743\t        ]\n744\t      }\n745\t    ],\n746\t    \"figures\": [],\n747\t    \"analysis\": \"QLoRA 的成功并不削弱 7-feature 的贡献：(1) 7-feature 提供了可解释的 DDR 框架，QLoRA 是 black box；(2) 7-feature 的 reference model 仅 410M，QLoRA 需 1.7B+；(3) QLoRA 同样 受 5-class ceiling 限制，确认这是 task boundary 而非 method limitation。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，QLoRA fine-tuned models 以 3-class F1 0.859–0.907 大幅超越 7-feature ensemble 的 0.762（+10–15 pp），证明 learned representations 能捕获 handcrafted features 遗漏的深层信号。但 5-class F1 仍仅 ~0.60，说明 resolution ceiling 是 task-intrinsic 而非 feature engineering 限制。Binary F1 提升较小（0.793–0.867 vs 0.694）， 因为 binary task 的 bottleneck 在 gen-1/gen-2+ 边界，learned features 也难以完全突破。 Instruct model 意外地与 base model 表现接近甚至略优（OLMo instruct 0.888 vs base 0.859）， 因为 QLoRA 的端到端学习可以 bypass DDR degradation，直接从 raw text 学习 depth pattern。 审稿人在 best 档下接受 7-feature 的定位转换：不追求绝对最优，而是 efficiency advantage（单次 Pythia-410M forward pass vs QLoRA 推理的 ~15× 成本差距）。\\n\"\n748\t  },\n749\t  {\n750\t    \"name\": \"text_length_control\",\n751\t    \"description\": \"文本长度 confound 控制：分析长度分布、length-normalized features、length-matched evaluation\\n\",\n752\t    \"results\": {\n753\t      \"length_depth_spearman_range\": \"[−0.066, +0.134]\",\n754\t      \"length_is_confound\": false,\n755\t      \"normalized_ttr_trend_preserved\": true,\n756\t      \"normalized_hapax_trend_preserved\": true,\n757\t      \"normalized_rho_stronger\": true,\n758\t      \"length_matched_f1\": 0.724,\n759\t      \"unmatched_f1\": 0.77,\n760\t      \"length_matched_delta\": \"−0.046\",\n761\t      \"dropout_short_text_bias\": true\n762\t    },\n763\t    \"tables\": [\n764\t      {\n765\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.8: Length confound analysis\",\n766\t        \"columns\": [\n767\t          \"Condition\",\n768\t          \"Binary F1\",\n769\t          \"Δ vs unmatched\"\n770\t        ],\n771\t        \"rows\": [\n772\t          [\n773\t            \"Unmatched (full)\",\n774\t            0.77,\n775\t            \"—\"\n776\t          ],\n777\t          [\n778\t            \"Length-matched\",\n779\t            0.724,\n780\t            \"−0.046\"\n781\t          ],\n782\t          [\n783\t            \"Random subsample control\",\n784\t            0.724,\n785\t            \"−0.046\"\n786\t          ]\n787\t        ]\n788\t      }\n789\t    ],\n790\t    \"figures\": [],\n791\t    \"analysis\": \"Length confound 是 reviewer 高频关注点（RC10）。−4.6 pp drop 的来源是 deconfounding 而非信息损失，这通过 random subsample control 证实。Length-matched F1=0.724 可作为 conservative lower bound 报告在 abstract 中。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，text length 与 depth 的 Spearman ρ 在 [−0.066, +0.134] 范围内（弱相关）， 排除 length 作为主要 confound。Length-normalized features（TTR, hapax 在 fixed-length window 上计算）保持甚至增强了 depth 趋势（normalized ρ stronger），说明 DDR drift 不是 length artifact。Length-matched 后 F1 从 0.770 降至 0.724（−4.6 pp），但对照实验确认 这一 drop 来自 deconfounding 而非 sample size reduction（random subsample control 也降 相同幅度）。Depth 增加→更多短文本 dropout 的 bias 被确认，但通过 length matching 控制后 signal 仍然显著（0.724 >> 0.5）。审稿人在 best 档下接受 length-matched 0.724 作为 conservative 的 deconfounded 估计。\\n\"\n792\t  },\n793\t  {\n794\t    \"name\": \"large_scale_generator\",\n795\t    \"description\": \"添加 7B+ generator（Qwen3-8B-Base）测试 frontier scale 下的 depth signal\\n\",\n796\t    \"results\": {\n797\t      \"total_records\": 4497,\n798\t      \"unique_seeds\": 995,\n799\t      \"depth_dist\": {\n800\t        \"0\": 995,\n801\t        \"1\": 979,\n802\t        \"2\": 937,\n803\t        \"3\": 831,\n804\t        \"4\": 755\n805\t      },\n806\t      \"logo_6gen_avg_f1\": 0.789,\n807\t      \"qwen3_8b_held_out_f1\": 0.683,\n808\t      \"logo_5gen_baseline_f1\": 0.8,\n809\t      \"spearman_hapax\": \"−0.558\",\n810\t      \"spearman_ttr\": \"−0.542\",\n811\t      \"spearman_entropy_mean\": \"−0.475\",\n812\t      \"spearman_tail_decay\": \"−0.089\",\n813\t      \"feature_importance_top3\": [\n814\t        \"hapax_ratio (0.269)\",\n815\t        \"entropy_mean (0.164)\",\n816\t        \"ttr (0.159)\"\n817\t      ]\n818\t    },\n819\t    \"tables\": [\n820\t      {\n821\t        \"caption\": \"Table 11: 6-generator LOGO with Qwen3-8B\",\n822\t        \"columns\": [\n823\t          \"Generator\",\n824\t          \"LOGO F1\",\n825\t          \"hapax ρ\",\n826\t          \"Scale\"\n827\t        ],\n828\t        \"rows\": [\n829\t          [\n830\t            \"Pythia-1B\",\n831\t            0.856,\n832\t            \"−0.65\",\n833\t            \"1.0B\"\n834\t          ],\n835\t          [\n836\t            \"Qwen3-0.6B\",\n837\t            0.824,\n838\t            \"−0.63\",\n839\t            \"0.6B\"\n840\t          ],\n841\t          [\n842\t            \"Qwen3-1.7B\",\n843\t            0.805,\n844\t            \"−0.61\",\n845\t            \"1.7B\"\n846\t          ],\n847\t          [\n848\t            \"Pythia-2.8B\",\n849\t            0.804,\n850\t            \"−0.63\",\n851\t            \"2.8B\"\n852\t          ],\n853\t          [\n854\t            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n855\t            0.764,\n856\t            \"−0.60\",\n857\t            \"1.5B\"\n858\t          ],\n859\t          [\n860\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n861\t            0.683,\n862\t            \"−0.56\",\n863\t            \"8.0B\"\n864\t          ]\n865\t        ]\n866\t      }\n867\t    ],\n868\t    \"figures\": [],\n869\t    \"analysis\": \"Scale degradation 是最重要的 scope limitation 之一。6-gen LOGO 加入 8B 后均值从 0.800 降至 0.789，Qwen3-8B 拉低了整体。但 DDR pattern（drifting vs stationary）在 8B 下完全 保持，说明这是 amplitude reduction 而非 qualitative change。Feature importance 排序 不变（hapax > entropy_mean > ttr），confirmed DDR 的 cross-scale robustness。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，Qwen3-8B held-out F1=0.683 低于 6-gen 平均 0.789（−10.6 pp）， 证实 larger models 产生更弱的 depth signal。物理解释：8B 模型的更高容量压缩了 depth-wise feature margins——更强的 language model 在每步生成中保持了更接近 source distribution 的输出，DDR location shift 幅度减小。但 0.683 仍显著高于 random（0.5）， 且 DDR 方向一致（hapax ρ=−0.558, tail_decay ρ=−0.089 仍为 stationary）。 审稿人在 best 档下接受 scale effect 作为 honest limitation with analysis， 而非 fatal flaw——0.683 在 8B scale 下仍为 non-trivial signal。Depth retention 从 d0 到 d4 降至 0.759（995→755），高 dropout 率部分解释了 F1 下降。\\n\"\n870\t  },\n871\t  {\n872\t    \"name\": \"ordinal_baseline_comparison\",\n873\t    \"description\": \"关键 baseline：测试现有 detector（FastDetectGPT, Binoculars, LD-Score）的连续分数 是否已提供 ordinal depth signal\\n\",\n874\t    \"results\": {\n875\t      \"seven_feature_logo_f1\": 0.798,\n876\t      \"seven_feature_ci\": [\n877\t        0.786,\n878\t        0.799\n879\t      ],\n880\t      \"avg_logprob_logo_f1\": 0.765,\n881\t      \"avg_logprob_ci\": [\n882\t        0.616,\n883\t        0.82\n884\t      ],\n885\t      \"ld_score_logo_f1\": 0.721,\n886\t      \"ld_score_ci\": [\n887\t        0.588,\n888\t        0.77\n889\t      ],\n890\t      \"fast_detect_gpt_logo_f1\": 0.627,\n891\t      \"fast_detect_gpt_ci\": [\n892\t        0.511,\n893\t        0.762\n894\t      ],\n895\t      \"binoculars_logo_f1\": 0.579,\n896\t      \"binoculars_ci\": [\n897\t        0.405,\n898\t        0.664\n899\t      ],\n900\t      \"bootstrap_7feat_vs_avglogprob\": {\n901\t        \"delta\": 0.039,\n902\t        \"p\": 0.0,\n903\t        \"significant\": true\n904\t      },\n905\t      \"bootstrap_7feat_vs_fdgpt\": {\n906\t        \"delta\": 0.067,\n907\t        \"p\": 0.0,\n908\t        \"significant\": true\n909\t      },\n910\t      \"best_single_detector\": \"Avg-LogProb (0.765)\",\n911\t      \"seven_feature_advantage_pp\": 3.3\n912\t    },\n913\t    \"tables\": [\n914\t      {\n915\t        \"caption\": \"Table 5: Ordinal baseline comparison (LOGO)\",\n916\t        \"columns\": [\n917\t          \"Method\",\n918\t          \"LOGO F1\",\n919\t          \"95% CI\",\n920\t          \"Spearman ρ\",\n921\t          \"Δ vs 7-feature\"\n922\t        ],\n923\t        \"rows\": [\n924\t          [\n925\t            \"7-feature ensemble\",\n926\t            0.798,\n927\t            \"[0.786, 0.799]\",\n928\t            \"—\",\n929\t            \"—\"\n930\t          ],\n931\t          [\n932\t            \"Avg-LogProb\",\n933\t            0.765,\n934\t            \"[0.616, 0.820]\",\n935\t            0.788,\n936\t            \"−0.033\"\n937\t          ],\n938\t          [\n939\t            \"LD-Score\",\n940\t            0.721,\n941\t            \"[0.588, 0.770]\",\n942\t            0.794,\n943\t            \"−0.077\"\n944\t          ],\n945\t          [\n946\t            \"FastDetectGPT\",\n947\t            0.627,\n948\t            \"[0.511, 0.762]\",\n949\t            0.433,\n950\t            \"−0.171\"\n951\t          ],\n952\t          [\n953\t            \"Binoculars\",\n954\t            0.579,\n955\t            \"[0.405, 0.664]\",\n956\t            0.199,\n957\t            \"−0.219\"\n958\t          ]\n959\t        ]\n960\t      }\n961\t    ],\n962\t    \"figures\": [],\n963\t    \"analysis\": \"这是论文中最关键的 baseline comparison——如果 Avg-LogProb alone 达到 0.80+，7-feature 的 contribution 就会被严重削弱。0.765 vs 0.798 的差距虽小但真实：7-feature 的优势 集中在 cross-generator 泛化（更窄 CI）和 gen-0 discrimination（surface features 必需）。 Binoculars 的 bug fix（denominator 从 CE(performer, obs_argmax) 改为 CE(performer, shifted_ids)）确保了公平比较。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，7-feature ensemble（0.798）显著优于所有 single-detector baselines （bootstrap p=0 for all pairwise comparisons）。最强 baseline Avg-LogProb（0.765） 差 3.3 pp，这一差距虽不大但统计显著——关键在于 7-feature 的 CI [0.786, 0.799] 与 Avg-LogProb 的 CI [0.616, 0.820] 不重叠于下界。Avg-LogProb 的强表现说明 ordinal depth signal 部分可被简单的 log-probability 特征捕获（Spearman ρ=0.788），但 7-feature 通过 组合 drifting + stationary 特征实现了更稳定的跨生成器泛化（更窄的 CI）。 FastDetectGPT（0.627）和 Binoculars（0.579）表现较差，因为它们设计为 binary detectors， 连续分数的 ordinal sensitivity 有限。LD-Score（0.721）居中，character-level 信息 提供了中等 ordinal signal。审稿人在 best 档下接受 7-feature 的优势为 \\\"modest but consistent\\\"——贡献不在于绝对性能碾压，而在于 DDR 框架的可解释性和互补性。\\n\"\n964\t  },\n965\t  {\n966\t    \"name\": \"9gen_scale_evaluation\",\n967\t    \"description\": \"扩展至 9 generators（+Gemma-2-2B, Llama-3.2-3B, Mistral-7B-v0.3）， 验证 8→9 gen 的 scaling behavior\\n\",\n968\t    \"results\": {\n969\t      \"9gen_logo_3class_f1\": 0.751,\n970\t      \"9gen_logo_binary_f1\": 0.666,\n971\t      \"8gen_baseline_3class_f1\": 0.77,\n972\t      \"delta_9gen_vs_8gen\": \"−0.019\",\n973\t      \"gemma_held_out_3class_f1\": 0.628,\n974\t      \"gemma_held_out_binary_f1\": 0.44,\n975\t      \"mistral_held_out_3class_f1\": 0.605,\n976\t      \"mistral_held_out_binary_f1\": 0.633,\n977\t      \"n_generators\": 9,\n978\t      \"n_total_rows\": 42015\n979\t    },\n980\t    \"tables\": [\n981\t      {\n982\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.9: 9-generator per-generator LOGO F1\",\n983\t        \"columns\": [\n984\t          \"Generator\",\n985\t          \"3-class F1\",\n986\t          \"Binary F1\",\n987\t          \"Family\"\n988\t        ],\n989\t        \"rows\": [\n990\t          [\n991\t            \"Pythia-1B\",\n992\t            0.857,\n993\t            0.724,\n994\t            \"Pythia\"\n995\t          ],\n996\t          [\n997\t            \"Qwen3-0.6B\",\n998\t            0.819,\n999\t            0.71,\n1000\t            \"Qwen\"\n1001\t          ],\n1002\t          [\n1003\t            \"Pythia-2.8B\",\n1004\t            0.812,\n1005\t            0.7,\n1006\t            \"Pythia\"\n1007\t          ],\n1008\t          [\n1009\t            \"Qwen3-1.7B\",\n1010\t            0.811,\n1011\t            0.698,\n1012\t            \"Qwen\"\n1013\t          ],\n1014\t          [\n1015\t            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n1016\t            0.773,\n1017\t            0.663,\n1018\t            \"OLMo\"\n1019\t          ],\n1020\t          [\n1021\t            \"Llama-3.2-3B\",\n1022\t            0.759,\n1023\t            0.68,\n1024\t            \"Llama\"\n1025\t          ],\n1026\t          [\n1027\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n1028\t            0.696,\n1029\t            0.647,\n1030\t            \"Qwen\"\n1031\t          ],\n1032\t          [\n1033\t            \"Gemma-2-2B\",\n1034\t            0.628,\n1035\t            0.44,\n1036\t            \"Gemma\"\n1037\t          ],\n1038\t          [\n1039\t            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n1040\t            0.605,\n1041\t            0.633,\n1042\t            \"Mistral\"\n1043\t          ]\n1044\t        ]\n1045\t      }\n1046\t    ],\n1047\t    \"figures\": [],\n1048\t    \"analysis\": \"9-gen 是 thoroughness 的体现。Gemma anomaly 提供了 negative case study：当 tokenizer 差异过大时，cross-model reference 特征的假设被违反。这实际上深化了 DDR 的理解—— DDR 依赖于 reference model 与 generator 之间的 tokenizer compatibility。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，9-gen LOGO 3-class F1=0.751 较 8-gen 的 0.770 降 1.9 pp，主要由 Gemma-2-2B 的异常表现拉低（gen-1 F1=0.036）。Gemma 的异常来自其独特的 tokenizer （SentencePiece vs BPE）导致 reference model 特征提取偏移。Mistral-7B 的 0.605 反映了 7B scale 的 signal compression（与 plan_014 Qwen3-8B 的 0.696 一致）。 审稿人在 best 档下接受 Gemma anomaly 作为 honest outlier analysis（appendix 中详细 讨论 tokenizer mismatch），8-gen 结果作为 primary metric，9-gen 作为 robustness check。 Binary F1 0.666 是 conservative lower bound——Gemma 的 binary F1=0.440 接近 random。\\n\"\n1049\t  },\n1050\t  {\n1051\t    \"name\": \"ddr_causality_analysis\",\n1052\t    \"description\": \"DDR causality analysis: permutation importance + Granger causality + feature intervention\\n\",\n1053\t    \"results\": {\n1054\t      \"permutation_baseline_f1\": 0.771,\n1055\t      \"drifting_avg_importance\": 0.158,\n1056\t      \"stationary_avg_importance\": 0.03,\n1057\t      \"drifting_stationary_ratio\": 5.31,\n1058\t      \"granger_significant_features\": \"6/7\",\n1059\t      \"granger_nonsig_feature\": \"entropy_min\",\n1060\t      \"granger_max_delta_r2\": 0.031,\n1061\t      \"granger_panel_n\": 29095,\n1062\t      \"intervention_max_f1_drop\": 0.02\n1063\t    },\n1064\t    \"tables\": [\n1065\t      {\n1066\t        \"caption\": \"Table 6: DDR causality analysis\",\n1067\t        \"columns\": [\n1068\t          \"Feature\",\n1069\t          \"Perm Importance\",\n1070\t          \"Granger sig\",\n1071\t          \"Category\"\n1072\t        ],\n1073\t        \"rows\": [\n1074\t          [\n1075\t            \"hapax_ratio\",\n1076\t            0.289,\n1077\t            \"✓ (p<0.001)\",\n1078\t            \"Drifting\"\n1079\t          ],\n1080\t          [\n1081\t            \"ttr\",\n1082\t            0.168,\n1083\t            \"✓ (p<0.001)\",\n1084\t            \"Drifting\"\n1085\t          ],\n1086\t          [\n1087\t            \"entropy_mean\",\n1088\t            0.16,\n1089\t            \"✓ (p<0.001)\",\n1090\t            \"Drifting\"\n1091\t          ],\n1092\t          [\n1093\t            \"entropy_std\",\n1094\t            0.046,\n1095\t            \"✓ (p<0.05)\",\n1096\t            \"Stationary\"\n1097\t          ],\n1098\t          [\n1099\t            \"entropy_max\",\n1100\t            0.063,\n1101\t            \"✓ (p<0.01)\",\n1102\t            \"Stationary\"\n1103\t          ],\n1104\t          [\n1105\t            \"entropy_min\",\n1106\t            0.015,\n1107\t            \"✗ (p=0.12)\",\n1108\t            \"Stationary\"\n1109\t          ],\n1110\t          [\n1111\t            \"tail_decay\",\n1112\t            0.012,\n1113\t            \"✓ (p<0.05)\",\n1114\t            \"Stationary\"\n1115\t          ]\n1116\t        ]\n1117\t      }\n1118\t    ],\n1119\t    \"figures\": [],\n1120\t    \"analysis\": \"Causality analysis 是论文从 \\\"observation\\\" 升级到 \\\"empirical contribution\\\" 的关键。 仅报告 DDR correlation 会被审稿人视为 descriptive；加入 Granger + permutation + intervention 三角验证后，DDR 的 causal status 被充分支撑。entropy_min 的 Granger 不显著实际上增强了可信度——不是所有特征都需要 causal relationship。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，drifting/stationary 分离经三重 causality test 验证：(1) Permutation importance 5.3× gap（drifting 0.158 vs stationary 0.030）确认 drifting 特征对分类的 贡献远超 stationary；(2) 6/7 Granger 显著（仅 entropy_min 不显著）确认 depth→feature 的 temporal causality；(3) Feature intervention 的最大 F1 drop 仅 0.020 pp 表明 单特征 intervention 不足以破坏分类——signal 分布在 drifting 特征组合中。 审稿人在 best 档下将这组 causality evidence 视为 \\\"sufficient\\\" 而非 \\\"mere correlation\\\"， 认可 DDR 作为 genuine empirical contribution 而非 vocabulary impoverishment 的重新包装。 5.5× permutation gap + 6/7 Granger 的组合在 Findings 级别属于 strong evidence。\\n\"\n1121\t  },\n1122\t  {\n1123\t    \"name\": \"tost_bootstrap_stability\",\n1124\t    \"description\": \"TOST bootstrap 验证 stationary 特征的稳定性\\n\",\n1125\t    \"results\": {\n1126\t      \"n_bootstrap\": 1000,\n1127\t      \"margin_d\": 0.2,\n1128\t      \"entropy_max\": {\n1129\t        \"median_p\": 0.0,\n1130\t        \"rejection_rate\": 1.0,\n1131\t        \"median_d\": 0.062\n1132\t      },\n1133\t      \"entropy_min\": {\n1134\t        \"median_p\": 0.0,\n1135\t        \"rejection_rate\": 1.0,\n1136\t        \"median_d\": \"−0.016\"\n1137\t      },\n1138\t      \"tail_decay\": {\n1139\t        \"median_p\": 0.0,\n1140\t        \"rejection_rate\": 1.0,\n1141\t        \"median_d\": 0.088\n1142\t      },\n1143\t      \"entropy_std\": {\n1144\t        \"median_p\": 1.0,\n1145\t        \"rejection_rate\": 0.0,\n1146\t        \"median_d\": 0.458\n1147\t      },\n1148\t      \"stationary_features_robust\": true\n1149\t    },\n1150\t    \"tables\": [\n1151\t      {\n1152\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.10: TOST bootstrap stationarity test\",\n1153\t        \"columns\": [\n1154\t          \"Feature\",\n1155\t          \"Median d\",\n1156\t          \"TOST p\",\n1157\t          \"Rejection Rate\",\n1158\t          \"Status\"\n1159\t        ],\n1160\t        \"rows\": [\n1161\t          [\n1162\t            \"entropy_max\",\n1163\t            0.062,\n1164\t            0.0,\n1165\t            1.0,\n1166\t            \"Stationary ✓\"\n1167\t          ],\n1168\t          [\n1169\t            \"entropy_min\",\n1170\t            \"−0.016\",\n1171\t            0.0,\n1172\t            1.0,\n1173\t            \"Stationary ✓\"\n1174\t          ],\n1175\t          [\n1176\t            \"tail_decay\",\n1177\t            0.088,\n1178\t            0.0,\n1179\t            1.0,\n1180\t            \"Stationary ✓\"\n1181\t          ],\n1182\t          [\n1183\t            \"entropy_std\",\n1184\t            0.458,\n1185\t            1.0,\n1186\t            0.0,\n1187\t            \"Intermediate (rejected)\"\n1188\t          ]\n1189\t        ]\n1190\t      }\n1191\t    ],\n1192\t    \"figures\": [],\n1193\t    \"analysis\": \"TOST bootstrap 为 DDR 分离提供了比 Spearman ρ 更严格的统计基础。entropy_std 的 intermediate status 实际上加强了论文的 nuance——不是简单的二分法，而是一个连续谱， 论文选择在 practical level 上维持 drifting/stationary 二分以保持 clarity。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，TOST bootstrap 确认 3/4 stationary-candidate 特征在 d=0.2 margin 下 统计等价于 depth-invariant（rejection rate=100%, median d<0.1）。entropy_std 被拒绝 （median d=0.458, rejection rate=0%），因为它虽然 Spearman ρ 低（−0.12）但 effect size 超出 equivalence margin——entropy_std 是 \\\"weak drifter\\\" 而非 true stationary。 这一发现精细化了 DDR 分类：3 strong drifters (hapax, TTR, entropy_mean) + 3 true stationary (entropy_max, entropy_min, tail_decay) + 1 intermediate (entropy_std)。 审稿人在 best 档下接受 TOST 作为比 ρ 更严格的 stationarity test，entropy_std 的 intermediate status 被视为 nuanced finding 而非 inconsistency。\\n\"\n1194\t  },\n1195\t  {\n1196\t    \"name\": \"instruct_model_degradation\",\n1197\t    \"description\": \"三个 instruct model（Qwen3-1.7B, OLMo-2-1B, Llama-3.2-3B）的 DDR 退化分析\\n\",\n1198\t    \"results\": {\n1199\t      \"qwen_instruct_logo_binary\": 0.658,\n1200\t      \"olmo_instruct_within_3class\": 0.575,\n1201\t      \"llama_instruct_3class\": 0.544,\n1202\t      \"qwen_base_logo_binary\": 0.821,\n1203\t      \"delta_logo_binary_qwen\": \"−0.163\",\n1204\t      \"features_reversed_olmo\": \"6/7\",\n1205\t      \"features_reversed_llama\": \"3/7 (entropy_mean, entropy_std, tail_decay)\",\n1206\t      \"spearman_direction_reversal\": true\n1207\t    },\n1208\t    \"tables\": [\n1209\t      {\n1210\t        \"caption\": \"Table 12: Instruct vs base model comparison\",\n1211\t        \"columns\": [\n1212\t          \"Model\",\n1213\t          \"Type\",\n1214\t          \"LOGO Binary F1\",\n1215\t          \"3-class F1\",\n1216\t          \"Features Reversed\"\n1217\t        ],\n1218\t        \"rows\": [\n1219\t          [\n1220\t            \"Qwen3-1.7B\",\n1221\t            \"Base\",\n1222\t            0.821,\n1223\t            0.769,\n1224\t            0\n1225\t          ],\n1226\t          [\n1227\t            \"Qwen3-1.7B\",\n1228\t            \"Instruct\",\n1229\t            0.658,\n1230\t            0.543,\n1231\t            \"ρ direction\"\n1232\t          ],\n1233\t          [\n1234\t            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n1235\t            \"Base\",\n1236\t            0.845,\n1237\t            0.754,\n1238\t            0\n1239\t          ],\n1240\t          [\n1241\t            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n1242\t            \"Instruct\",\n1243\t            0.813,\n1244\t            0.575,\n1245\t            \"6/7\"\n1246\t          ],\n1247\t          [\n1248\t            \"Llama-3.2-3B\",\n1249\t            \"Base\",\n1250\t            0.849,\n1251\t            0.742,\n1252\t            0\n1253\t          ],\n1254\t          [\n1255\t            \"Llama-3.2-3B\",\n1256\t            \"Instruct\",\n1257\t            0.838,\n1258\t            0.544,\n1259\t            \"3/7\"\n1260\t          ]\n1261\t        ]\n1262\t      }\n1263\t    ],\n1264\t    \"figures\": [],\n1265\t    \"analysis\": \"Instruct 退化的 mechanism analysis（feature reversal, not just signal weakening）是 超越简单 \\\"instruct doesn't work\\\" 报告的 value-add。Format compliance hypothesis 可 在 future work 中通过 constrained decoding 实验验证。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，instruct model 的 DDR 退化被系统性确认：LOGO binary F1 从 base 0.821 降至 instruct 0.658（Qwen, −16.3 pp），OLMo instruct 的 6/7 features Spearman 方向 反转（ρ 从负变正），说明 instruction tuning 的 length regulation 和 format constraints 根本性地改变了 depth-feature relationship。物理解释：alignment 训练强制模型在所有 depth 上产生相似的 token distribution（format compliance），压缩了 DDR 依赖的 distributional variation。这是 base-model-only scope 的核心证据。审稿人在 best 档下 将诚实报告视为 strength：不隐藏 limitation，反而深入分析其 mechanism（feature reversal + format compression hypothesis）。0 instruct scope penalty。\\n\"\n1266\t  },\n1267\t  {\n1268\t    \"name\": \"temperature_sensitivity\",\n1269\t    \"description\": \"Temperature sensitivity curve (t=0.5, 0.7, 0.9, 1.0) + cross-temperature transfer\\n\",\n1270\t    \"results\": {\n1271\t      \"t05_logo_binary_f1\": 0.814,\n1272\t      \"t07_logo_binary_f1\": 0.694,\n1273\t      \"t09_logo_binary_f1\": 0.48,\n1274\t      \"within_t07_binary\": 0.947,\n1275\t      \"cross_t07_to_t10_binary\": 0.9,\n1276\t      \"cross_t07_to_t10_qwen_only_binary\": 0.757,\n1277\t      \"cross_t07_to_t10_qwen_only_3class\": 0.458,\n1278\t      \"entropy_mean_rho_t05\": \"−0.584\",\n1279\t      \"entropy_mean_rho_t07\": \"−0.600\",\n1280\t      \"entropy_mean_rho_t09\": \"−0.302\"\n1281\t    },\n1282\t    \"tables\": [\n1283\t      {\n1284\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.4: Temperature sensitivity\",\n1285\t        \"columns\": [\n1286\t          \"Temperature\",\n1287\t          \"Within-CV Binary F1\",\n1288\t          \"LOGO Binary F1\",\n1289\t          \"entropy_mean ρ\"\n1290\t        ],\n1291\t        \"rows\": [\n1292\t          [\n1293\t            0.5,\n1294\t            0.843,\n1295\t            0.814,\n1296\t            \"−0.584\"\n1297\t          ],\n1298\t          [\n1299\t            \"0.7 (default)\",\n1300\t            0.947,\n1301\t            0.694,\n1302\t            \"−0.600\"\n1303\t          ],\n1304\t          [\n1305\t            0.9,\n1306\t            0.582,\n1307\t            0.48,\n1308\t            \"−0.302\"\n1309\t          ]\n1310\t        ]\n1311\t      }\n1312\t    ],\n1313\t    \"figures\": [],\n1314\t    \"analysis\": \"Temperature sensitivity 直接关联 DDR 的 location-shift 解释：高温增大了每步采样的 distributional noise，削弱了 deterministic drift component。t=0.5 下 signal 更强 因为低温采样更 deterministic，location shift 更 clean。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，DDR 在 t∈[0.5, 0.7] 范围内稳定（≤1 pp degradation from default）， t=0.9 大幅退化（−21.4 pp），t=1.0 进一步恶化。Cross-temperature transfer 严重不对称： t=0.7→t=1.0 降 16.9 pp（Qwen-only binary），t=1.0→t=0.7 仅降微弱。物理解释： 高温增大 sampling noise，entropy_mean 的 depth-wise drift 被 within-depth variance 淹没（ρ 从 −0.60 降至 −0.002 at t=1.0）。审稿人在 best 档下接受 t∈[0.5, 0.9] 为 reliable range，t=1.0 degradation 作为 transparent limitation。\\n\"\n1315\t  },\n1316\t  {\n1317\t    \"name\": \"independent_seed_validation\",\n1318\t    \"description\": \"Independent seed validation：不同生成器使用完全独立的 seed 集\\n\",\n1319\t    \"results\": {\n1320\t      \"pythia_to_olmo_binary_f1\": 0.695,\n1321\t      \"olmo_to_pythia_binary_f1\": 0.666,\n1322\t      \"avg_binary_f1\": 0.68,\n1323\t      \"shared_seed_logo_ref\": 0.694,\n1324\t      \"delta_vs_shared\": \"−0.014\"\n1325\t    },\n1326\t    \"tables\": [\n1327\t      {\n1328\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.11: Independent vs shared seed evaluation\",\n1329\t        \"columns\": [\n1330\t          \"Condition\",\n1331\t          \"Binary F1\",\n1332\t          \"Δ\"\n1333\t        ],\n1334\t        \"rows\": [\n1335\t          [\n1336\t            \"Shared seed LOGO\",\n1337\t            0.694,\n1338\t            \"—\"\n1339\t          ],\n1340\t          [\n1341\t            \"Independent seed (Pythia→OLMo)\",\n1342\t            0.695,\n1343\t            0.001\n1344\t          ],\n1345\t          [\n1346\t            \"Independent seed (OLMo→Pythia)\",\n1347\t            0.666,\n1348\t            \"−0.028\"\n1349\t          ],\n1350\t          [\n1351\t            \"Independent seed avg\",\n1352\t            0.68,\n1353\t            \"−0.014\"\n1354\t          ]\n1355\t        ]\n1356\t      }\n1357\t    ],\n1358\t    \"figures\": [],\n1359\t    \"analysis\": \"Independent seed validation 关闭了 seed sharing leakage 的替代假说。 1.4 pp 差异可归因于 generator-specific difficulty 差异而非 leakage。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，independent seed 的 avg binary F1=0.680 vs shared seed LOGO 0.694 仅差 1.4 pp，确认 shared seed 不构成显著 leakage。这排除了 \\\"performance inflated by seed sharing\\\" 的 critique。1.4 pp 差异在 bootstrap CI 内，不具统计显著性。 方向不对称（Pythia→OLMo 0.695 vs OLMo→Pythia 0.666）反映了 OLMo 作为 test set 更难分类（与 LOGO 结果一致）。\\n\"\n1360\t  },\n1361\t  {\n1362\t    \"name\": \"topic_drift_control\",\n1363\t    \"description\": \"Semantic similarity analysis：控制 topic drift 作为 depth signal 的 confound\\n\",\n1364\t    \"results\": {\n1365\t      \"sim_0_to_1\": 0.622,\n1366\t      \"sim_1_to_2\": 0.683,\n1367\t      \"sim_2_to_3\": 0.801,\n1368\t      \"sim_3_to_4\": 0.859,\n1369\t      \"shape_entropy_std_rho\": \"−0.164\",\n1370\t      \"shape_tail_decay_rho\": 0.068,\n1371\t      \"drifting_entropy_mean_rho\": \"−0.286\"\n1372\t    },\n1373\t    \"tables\": [\n1374\t      {\n1375\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.12: Semantic similarity by depth transition\",\n1376\t        \"columns\": [\n1377\t          \"Transition\",\n1378\t          \"Mean Sim\",\n1379\t          \"Std\"\n1380\t        ],\n1381\t        \"rows\": [\n1382\t          [\n1383\t            \"depth 0→1\",\n1384\t            0.622,\n1385\t            0.165\n1386\t          ],\n1387\t          [\n1388\t            \"depth 1→2\",\n1389\t            0.683,\n1390\t            0.184\n1391\t          ],\n1392\t          [\n1393\t            \"depth 2→3\",\n1394\t            0.801,\n1395\t            0.201\n1396\t          ],\n1397\t          [\n1398\t            \"depth 3→4\",\n1399\t            0.859,\n1400\t            0.19\n1401\t          ]\n1402\t        ]\n1403\t      }\n1404\t    ],\n1405\t    \"figures\": [],\n1406\t    \"analysis\": \"Semantic convergence 与 vocabulary impoverishment 是相关但不同的现象：text 变得 semantically more similar（topic narrowing）但 statistically less diverse（DDR drift）。 两者的解耦证明 DDR 不是 topic drift 的简单 proxy。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，semantic similarity 随 depth 递增（0.622→0.859），表明 deeper generation 趋向 semantic convergence（repetition/narrowing）。但 DDR feature-depth correlations 在控制 semantic similarity 后仍保持方向和显著性，说明 DDR 不仅仅是 topic drift 的 proxy。Shape features 与 semantic similarity 的 correlation 极弱（|ρ|<0.17）， 进一步确认 shape stationarity 独立于 topic dynamics。审稿人在 best 档下接受 topic drift 分析为 adequate confound control。\\n\"\n1407\t  },\n1408\t  {\n1409\t    \"name\": \"multi_detector_ensemble\",\n1410\t    \"description\": \"Multi-detector ensemble（4 detectors + surface features）vs 7-feature baseline\\n\",\n1411\t    \"results\": {\n1412\t      \"four_det_surface_3class_f1\": 0.795,\n1413\t      \"four_det_surface_binary_f1\": 0.708,\n1414\t      \"seven_feature_3class_f1\": 0.774,\n1415\t      \"seven_feature_binary_f1\": 0.705,\n1416\t      \"delta_3class\": 0.021,\n1417\t      \"delta_binary\": 0.003,\n1418\t      \"inference_cost_ratio\": 2.4,\n1419\t      \"gpu_memory_ratio\": 3.2\n1420\t    },\n1421\t    \"tables\": [\n1422\t      {\n1423\t        \"caption\": \"Table A.1: Multi-detector ensemble comparison\",\n1424\t        \"columns\": [\n1425\t          \"Model\",\n1426\t          \"3-class F1\",\n1427\t          \"Binary F1\",\n1428\t          \"Cost Ratio\"\n1429\t        ],\n1430\t        \"rows\": [\n1431\t          [\n1432\t            \"7-feature ensemble\",\n1433\t            0.774,\n1434\t            0.705,\n1435\t            \"1.0×\"\n1436\t          ],\n1437\t          [\n1438\t            \"4-det + surface\",\n1439\t            0.795,\n1440\t            0.708,\n1441\t            \"2.4×\"\n1442\t          ]\n1443\t        ]\n1444\t      }\n1445\t    ],\n1446\t    \"figures\": [],\n1447\t    \"analysis\": \"Multi-detector ensemble 的 marginal gains 进一步验证了 7-feature 的 cost-effectiveness。 3-class 差距 2.1 pp 大于 binary 0.3 pp，因为额外 detector features 主要帮助 gen-0/gen-1 区分（通过 detector-specific calibration），对 gen-1/gen-2+ boundary 几乎无效。\\n\\n在 best 档下，multi-detector ensemble 以 +2.1 pp (3-class) 和 +0.3 pp (binary) 微弱优于 7-feature，但代价是 2.4× inference cost 和 3.2× GPU memory。Binary F1 差距仅 0.3 pp（essentially equivalent），因为 binary task 的 gen-1/gen-2+ 边界是 intrinsic bottleneck，更多 features 无法突破。7-feature 的 efficiency advantage 在 best 档下被审稿人接受为合理的 positioning：not absolute best, but best cost-performance tradeoff。\\n\"\n1448\t  }\n1449\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"12403ebc-9514-4215-82a8-4a9860541744","uuid":"02219d42-269b-4bc0-a033-0453a9e0d717","timestamp":"2026-05-20T10:27:37.395Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_3/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T100349/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"feature_ablation_and_trend\",\n    \"description\": \"三部分分析：(A) Feature ablation — full vs reference-only vs surface-only； (B) DDR trend analysis — 每个 feature 的 depth-wise 趋势 + Spearman ρ； (C) Perplexity pre-validation for Claim 3\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"full_macro_f1\": 0.82,\n      \"reference_only_f1\": 0.719,\n      \"surface_only_f1\": 0.763,\n      \"ref_vs_surf_bootstrap_ci\": \"[0.706, 0.733] vs [0.747, 0.774]\",\n      \"drifting_features\": \"entropy_mean (ρ≈−0.60), TTR (ρ≈−0.61), hapax_ratio (ρ≈−0.63)\",\n      \"stationary_features\": \"tail_decay (ρ≈0.04), entropy_std (ρ≈−0.12), entropy_max (ρ≈0.05)\",\n      \"median_ppl_by_depth\": \"13.50 → 4.96 → 3.00 → 2.07 → 1.72\",\n      \"ppl_depth_monotonic\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 2: Feature ablation results (5-fold CV, Pythia-2.8B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Feature Set\",\n          \"N Features\",\n          \"Macro F1\",\n          \"95% CI\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Full\",\n            7,\n            0.82,\n            \"[0.807, 0.833]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Surface-only\",\n            2,\n            0.763,\n            \"[0.747, 0.774]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Reference-only\",\n            5,\n            0.719,\n            \"[0.706, 0.733]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 3: Feature-depth Spearman correlations\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Feature\",\n          \"ρ\",\n          \"Category\",\n          \"Trend\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"hapax_ratio\",\n            \"−0.63\",\n            \"Drifting\",\n            \"Monotonic decrease\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TTR\",\n            \"−0.61\",\n            \"Drifting\",\n            \"Monotonic decrease\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"entropy_mean\",\n            \"−0.60\",\n            \"Drifting\",\n            \"Monotonic decrease\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"entropy_min\",\n            \"−0.39\",\n            \"Intermediate\",\n            \"Moderate decrease\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"entropy_std\",\n            \"−0.12\",\n            \"Stationary\",\n            \"Near-flat\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"entropy_max\",\n            0.05,\n            \"Stationary\",\n            \"Near-flat\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"tail_decay\",\n            0.04,\n            \"Stationary\",\n            \"Near-flat\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Full > Surface > Reference 的排序表明 surface 特征（TTR, hapax）捕获了最强的单维信号， 但 reference 特征提供了不可替代的互补信息。Surface-only 虽然绝对值更高，但 reference-only 在 binary task（gen-1 vs gen-2+）上表现更优（binary F1=0.833 vs 0.695），这是因为 reference 特征在排除 gen-0 后捕获了更 fine-grained 的 NLL 分布位移。 DDR 分离的物理解释：递归生成诱导 NLL 分布的 location shift，central-tendency 指标（mean, TTR, hapax）跟踪这一 shift 因而漂移，shape 指标（max, tail_decay）反映分布形态因而稳定。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，full 7-feature 以 0.820 显著高于两个 subset（McNemar p≈0）， surface-only 以 0.763 高于 reference-only 0.719，但两者都显著低于 full， 证明互补性而非冗余性。审稿人接受这一 4.4 pp gap 作为 complementarity 证据。 DDR 趋势清晰：drifting 三特征 |ρ|>0.60 呈单调下降，shape 特征 |ρ|<0.12 近乎水平。Perplexity 随 depth 单调下降（13.50→1.72）预验证 Claim 3 信号存在。 这组结果为后续所有实验奠定特征空间基础。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross_generator_evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"扩展至 5 generators（Pythia-2.8B, Pythia-1B, OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-1.7B, Qwen3-0.6B）， LOGO 交叉验证评估跨生成器泛化性\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 18423,\n      \"generators\": 5,\n      \"logo_avg_macro_f1\": 0.804,\n      \"logo_best_held_out\": {\n        \"model\": \"pythia-1b\",\n        \"f1\": 0.851\n      },\n      \"logo_worst_held_out\": {\n        \"model\": \"olmo-2-1b\",\n        \"f1\": 0.752\n      },\n      \"lofo_delta\": 0.011,\n      \"ablation_full_f1\": 0.804,\n      \"ablation_reference_only_f1\": 0.754,\n      \"ablation_surface_only_f1\": 0.747,\n      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.0,\n      \"top3_features\": [\n        \"hapax_ratio (0.289)\",\n        \"ttr (0.168)\",\n        \"entropy_mean (0.160)\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 4: LOGO cross-generator evaluation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Held-out Generator\",\n          \"Macro F1\",\n          \"Binary F1\",\n          \"Gen-1 F1\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Pythia-1B\",\n            0.851,\n            0.724,\n            0.689\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-0.6B\",\n            0.824,\n            0.71,\n            0.652\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-1.7B\",\n            0.805,\n            0.698,\n            0.641\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pythia-2.8B\",\n            0.804,\n            0.694,\n            0.638\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n            0.752,\n            0.663,\n            0.585\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Average\",\n            0.804,\n            0.694,\n            0.641\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"5-gen LOGO 为后续 8-gen/9-gen 扩展奠定基线。OLMo 的相对弱势来自其 tokenizer 和 训练数据分布与 Pythia/Qwen 的差异——这本身验证了 DDR 在不同预训练配方下的鲁棒性（仍 >0.75）。 LOFO delta 仅 0.011 说明 Pythia 家族重叠未严重膨胀 LOGO 指标。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，5-gen LOGO 均值 0.804 显示强跨生成器泛化。Pythia-1B held-out 最高（0.851） 因为 Pythia-2.8B 在训练集中提供了同家族信号；OLMo held-out 最低（0.752）因为 OLMo 的生成分布与 Pythia/Qwen 家族差异最大。Family-out delta 仅 0.011 pp，审稿人接受为 cross-family generalization 证据。Feature importance 排序（hapax > ttr > entropy_mean） 与 plan_001 一致，确认 surface drifting 特征是主驱动力，但 McNemar p≈0 证明 reference 特征对 full 集的贡献统计显著。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross_family_reference_model\",\n    \"description\": \"测试非 Pythia reference model（OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-0.6B）提取特征， 验证 DDR 是否为 generation-intrinsic 而非 reference-model artifact\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"logo_f1_pythia_ref\": 0.803,\n      \"logo_f1_olmo_ref\": 0.807,\n      \"logo_f1_qwen_ref\": 0.816,\n      \"entropy_drift_all_refs_negative\": true,\n      \"pythia_ref_drift_range\": \"[−1.19, −1.40]\",\n      \"olmo_ref_drift_range\": \"[−0.61, −0.91]\",\n      \"qwen_ref_drift_range\": \"[−0.96, −1.35]\",\n      \"dual_dynamics_is_pythia_artifact\": false\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 5: Cross-reference-model DDR validation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Reference Model\",\n          \"LOGO F1\",\n          \"entropy_mean drift range\",\n          \"DDR preserved\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Pythia-410M (default)\",\n            0.803,\n            \"[−1.19, −1.40]\",\n            \"✓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n            0.807,\n            \"[−0.61, −0.91]\",\n            \"✓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-0.6B\",\n            0.816,\n            \"[−0.96, −1.35]\",\n            \"✓\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"漂移幅度的差异（Pythia > Qwen > OLMo）反映了 reference model 自身 perplexity scale 的差异， 但方向一致性是关键。这排除了 \\\"DDR 只是 Pythia tokenizer 的 artifact\\\" 这一最致命的替代解释。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，三个 reference model 均产生负向 entropy drift（所有 range 为负）， LOGO F1 跨 reference 差异 <1.5 pp（0.803–0.816），关键性地证明 DDR 是 generation-intrinsic 现象而非 Pythia-410M 特有 artifact。Qwen reference 略优 可能因其 tokenizer 粒度更细，捕获了更丰富的 NLL 分布信息。这是 Claim 2 的核心 falsification test 通过：如果 DDR 消失于非 Pythia reference，整个 dual dynamics 叙事将崩塌。审稿人在 best 档下接受这一 3-reference 交叉验证为充分证据。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"downstream_utility\",\n    \"description\": \"OLMo-1B fine-tune on depth-stratified subsets，3 seeds with bootstrap CIs， sample-count-matched comparison。验证 Claim 3（negative finding）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_runs\": 15,\n      \"variants\": {\n        \"all\": {\n          \"ppl_mean\": 2.335,\n          \"ppl_std\": 0.0003\n        },\n        \"size_matched\": {\n          \"ppl_mean\": 2.367,\n          \"ppl_std\": 0.0002\n        },\n        \"depth01\": {\n          \"ppl_mean\": 2.387,\n          \"ppl_std\": 0.0005\n        },\n        \"binary_filtered\": {\n          \"ppl_mean\": 2.389,\n          \"ppl_std\": 0.0004\n        },\n        \"depth0_only\": {\n          \"ppl_mean\": 2.681,\n          \"ppl_std\": 0.0012\n        }\n      },\n      \"ranking\": \"all(2.335) < size_matched(2.367) < depth01(2.387) ≈ binary_filtered(2.389) << depth0_only(2.681)\",\n      \"tost_equivalence_p\": 0.00011,\n      \"tost_margin\": \"±2%\",\n      \"seed_variance\": \"<0.002 ppl across seeds within same variant\",\n      \"cohens_d_sizeMatched_vs_depth01\": \"inflated by low variance\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 7: Downstream CLM perplexity by training data composition (3 seeds)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Variant\",\n          \"N train\",\n          \"Ppl (mean±std)\",\n          \"Δ vs size_matched\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"All data\",\n            12299,\n            \"2.335 ± 0.0003\",\n            \"−0.032\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Size-matched random\",\n            3951,\n            \"2.367 ± 0.0002\",\n            \"— (baseline)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Depth 0+1 only\",\n            3951,\n            \"2.387 ± 0.0005\",\n            0.02\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Binary-filtered\",\n            3951,\n            \"2.389 ± 0.0004\",\n            0.022\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Depth 0 only\",\n            797,\n            \"2.681 ± 0.0012\",\n            0.314\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Negative finding 的关键价值在于终止了一个看似合理但无效的研究方向：既然 depth 信息存在且可检测， 自然会假设可用于数据筛选。实验证明这一假设不成立。More data > better data 在 3951 samples 的低数据量下尤为明显。TOST equivalence 而非 NHST 是正确的统计框架选择。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，negative finding 清晰：depth-aware filtering 不优于 random subsampling（size_matched 2.367 vs depth01 2.387，差 0.020 ppl）。TOST 在 ±2% margin 下 p=1.1×10⁻⁴ 确认统计等价。 depth0_only 的显著劣势（2.681）是预期的——纯人类文本量太少（797 samples）。关键是 size_matched vs depth01 的差异方向反直觉：random subsample 比 depth-curated 还好 0.020 ppl， 说明 depth 信息对下游 CLM 质量无 curative 价值。审稿人在 best 档下将此认可为 \\\"valuable honest science\\\" 而非 \\\"method doesn't work\\\"——论文诚实地将 depth fingerprinting 定位为 diagnostic tool（provenance characterization）而非 curative tool（data selection）。 三 seed 极低方差（<0.002）既增强结论可靠性，也意味着 Cohen's d 被人为放大，论文正确选择 TOST 而非 effect size 作为主检验。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"prompt_type_comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"比较 continuation / elaboration / inspired_rewriting 三种 prompt type 的 depth signal\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cv_f1\": {\n        \"continuation\": 0.781,\n        \"inspired_rewriting\": 0.737,\n        \"elaboration\": 0.73\n      },\n      \"lopto_f1\": {\n        \"held_out_continuation\": 0.762,\n        \"held_out_elaboration\": 0.762,\n        \"held_out_rewriting\": 0.733,\n        \"average\": 0.753\n      },\n      \"depth_retention_d4_d0\": {\n        \"continuation\": 0.831,\n        \"inspired_rewriting\": 0.939,\n        \"elaboration\": 0.986\n      },\n      \"drift_hapax\": {\n        \"continuation\": \"−0.74\",\n        \"elaboration\": \"−0.83\",\n        \"rewriting\": \"−0.80\"\n      },\n      \"drift_ttr\": {\n        \"continuation\": \"−0.607\",\n        \"elaboration\": \"−0.641\",\n        \"rewriting\": \"−0.618\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 8: Prompt-type comparison (Pythia-2.8B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Prompt Type\",\n          \"CV F1\",\n          \"LOPTO F1\",\n          \"Depth Retention\",\n          \"hapax ρ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Continuation\",\n            0.781,\n            0.762,\n            0.831,\n            \"−0.74\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Inspired rewriting\",\n            0.737,\n            0.733,\n            0.939,\n            \"−0.80\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Elaboration\",\n            0.73,\n            0.762,\n            0.986,\n            \"−0.83\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Prompt-type 差异本身是有趣发现：语义约束越强（elaboration > rewriting > continuation）， chain 越稳定但 depth discriminability 越低。这与 DDR 的 location-shift 解释一致—— 约束越强，模型输出分布被锚定在更窄的范围内，location shift 幅度减小。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，三种 prompt type 均保留 DDR 信号但强度不同。Continuation 的 within-type CV F1 最高（0.781）但 depth retention 最低（83.1%），因为 continuation 给予模型最大自由度， 导致更多 chain dropout 但也产生更强的 distributional shift。Elaboration retention 最高 （98.6%）但 CV F1 最低（0.730），因为 elaboration 约束模型围绕原文展开，压缩了 cross-depth 变异。Rewriting 居中。Leave-one-prompt-type-out 交叉验证（avg 0.753） 低于 within-type（avg 0.749）仅 ~0.4 pp，表明 prompt type 间的 DDR 信号高度可迁移。 审稿人接受 prompt-type dependence 的透明报告为 ecological validity 证据。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"paraphrastic_comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"构建平行 paraphrasing chains 与 continuation chains 直接比较， 测试 attractor convergence theory\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"paraphrase_cv_f1\": 0.62,\n      \"continuation_cv_f1\": 0.781,\n      \"paraphrase_depth_retention\": 0.97,\n      \"paraphrase_hapax_rho\": \"−0.25\",\n      \"paraphrase_entropy_mean_rho\": \"−0.18\",\n      \"attractor_convergence_depth\": 2,\n      \"delta_cv_f1\": \"−0.161\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 9: Paraphrastic vs non-paraphrastic chains\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Chain Type\",\n          \"CV F1\",\n          \"hapax ρ\",\n          \"entropy_mean ρ\",\n          \"Retention d4/d0\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Continuation\",\n            0.781,\n            \"−0.74\",\n            \"−0.56\",\n            0.831\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Paraphrasing\",\n            0.62,\n            \"−0.25\",\n            \"−0.18\",\n            0.97\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δ\",\n            \"−0.161\",\n            0.49,\n            0.38,\n            0.139\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是论文与 ACL 2025 attractor cycle 理论的关键联系点。Non-paraphrastic chains 不受 semantic-preservation attractor 约束，因此 distributional drift 可以持续到更深层， 为 depth estimation 提供更丰富的信号空间。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，paraphrasing chains 的 depth signal 显著弱于 continuation（CV F1 0.62 vs 0.781，−16.1 pp）。Paraphrasing 由于语义保持约束，每步输出被 attractor basin 拉回， depth 间差异在 depth 2 后趋于收敛（与 ACL 2025 \\\"LLM as Broken Telephone\\\" 的 ~3 class ceiling 一致）。DDR drifting 特征在 paraphrase 中 ρ 幅度大幅缩小（hapax −0.25 vs −0.63）， 因为 paraphrase 保持语义→保持词汇多样性→TTR/hapax drift 被抑制。这验证了论文核心定位： DDR 是 non-paraphrastic chain 特有的现象，paraphrastic chain 走向 attractor convergence。 审稿人在 best 档下接受这一对比作为 task formulation 的 motivation——深度估计在 continuation/elaboration chain 中才有 meaningful signal。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross_model_chains\",\n    \"description\": \"Cross-model chains（每步使用不同 generator）vs single-model chains， 模拟真实 web contamination 场景\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cross_model_binary_f1\": 0.83,\n      \"cross_model_3class_f1\": 0.789,\n      \"single_model_binary_f1\": 0.694,\n      \"single_model_3class_f1\": 0.762,\n      \"cross_model_logo_binary\": 0.83,\n      \"delta_binary_vs_single\": 0.136,\n      \"n_generators_in_cross\": 5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 6: Cross-model vs single-model chain evaluation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Setting\",\n          \"Binary F1\",\n          \"3-class F1\",\n          \"N Generators\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Single-model LOGO\",\n            0.694,\n            0.762,\n            \"8 (homogeneous)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Cross-model LOGO\",\n            0.83,\n            0.789,\n            \"5 (heterogeneous)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δ\",\n            0.136,\n            0.027,\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-model 的优势来自 generator heterogeneity amplifying distributional shifts。 在单模型 chain 中，depth-wise drift 是同一模型 bias 的累积；在 cross-model chain 中， 每步引入新模型 bias，产生更大的 inter-depth 特征差异。这是 ecological validity 的 正面证据：真实世界的 contamination 更可能涉及多个 generator。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，cross-model chains 的 binary F1 0.830 显著高于 single-model 0.694 （+13.6 pp），这一 counterintuitive 结果的原因是：不同 generator 在每步引入额外的 distributional discontinuity（不同 tokenizer bias, 不同 perplexity scale）， 放大了 depth 间的特征差异。这对审稿人而言是 strength——说明在更 realistic 的 heterogeneous contamination 场景下，depth signal 反而更强。0.830 cross-model binary F1 被 highlight 为 generalization evidence，审稿人接受 5-gen subset LOGO 作为评估方法。 3-class F1 同样提升（0.789 vs 0.762），但提升幅度小于 binary，因为 gen-0 identification 的 seed-sharing advantage 在两种设定下相当。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"multi_domain_seeds\",\n    \"description\": \"扩展至 4 domains（Wikipedia, news, scientific, creative/code）， 500 seeds/domain × 5 depths\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"news_binary_f1\": 0.746,\n      \"news_binary_ci\": [\n        0.726,\n        0.764\n      ],\n      \"academic_binary_f1\": 0.739,\n      \"academic_binary_ci\": [\n        0.72,\n        0.757\n      ],\n      \"code_binary_f1\": 0.754,\n      \"code_binary_ci\": [\n        0.737,\n        0.77\n      ],\n      \"wikipedia_baseline_binary_f1\": 0.815,\n      \"max_gap_vs_wiki_pp\": 7.62,\n      \"worst_domain\": \"academic\",\n      \"best_domain\": \"code\",\n      \"conclusion_label\": \"domain_independent\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 10: Multi-domain evaluation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Domain\",\n          \"Binary F1\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"3-class F1\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Wikipedia (baseline)\",\n            0.815,\n            \"[0.799, 0.831]\",\n            0.863\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Code\",\n            0.754,\n            \"[0.737, 0.770]\",\n            0.634\n          ],\n          [\n            \"News\",\n            0.746,\n            \"[0.726, 0.764]\",\n            0.652\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Academic\",\n            0.739,\n            \"[0.720, 0.757]\",\n            0.622\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Multi-domain 结果直接回应 RC6（ecological validity）。DDR 在 news/academic/code 上的 一致性说明 depth signal 不依赖于特定文本类型的 vocabulary 特征。3-class F1 的 domain 差异更大（0.622–0.863），因为 gen-0 vs gen-1 区分依赖 seed-specific 线索，这在 不同 domain 中差异更大。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，所有 domain 的 binary F1 均在 0.739–0.754 范围内（排除 Wikipedia 基线）， domain 间 max gap 仅 1.5 pp，审稿人接受 DDR 为 domain-independent 现象。Wikipedia 基线（0.815）高出 ~7 pp 是预期的——Wikipedia 种子文本结构化程度更高、长度更稳定， 减少了 confounding variation。Academic domain 最低（0.739）因为学术文本的词汇多样性 本身就高且 depth 间变化小（base model 生成学术文本时更依赖 template phrasing）。 Code domain 意外地最高（0.754），因为 code-like 文本的 entropy 分布更 bimodal， DDR drifting 在 entropy_mean 上更明显。所有 CI 均不包含 0.5（random baseline）， 确认 depth signal 在所有 domain 中统计显著。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"finer_grained_ordinal\",\n    \"description\": \"5-class 序数分类（gen-0 至 gen-4），测试更细粒度 depth resolution 的可行性\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"five_class_f1\": 0.5,\n      \"three_class_f1_reference\": 0.762,\n      \"ordinal_coral_f1\": 0.49,\n      \"ordinal_frank_hall_f1\": 0.5,\n      \"xgboost_standard_f1\": 0.5,\n      \"bottleneck\": \"gen-1/gen-2 boundary, 86% binary FNs concentrated here\",\n      \"gen3_vs_gen4_f1\": 0.35\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.3: Ordinal classification results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"3-class F1\",\n          \"5-class F1\",\n          \"Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"XGBoost (standard)\",\n            0.762,\n            0.5,\n            \"−0.262\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CORAL\",\n            0.758,\n            0.49,\n            \"−0.268\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Frank-Hall\",\n            0.76,\n            0.5,\n            \"−0.260\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"5-class 的 ceiling 与 DDR 的物理解释一致：location shift 在前几步（0→1→2）幅度最大， 之后递减。Gen-3 和 gen-4 的 NLL 分布差异已小于 feature extraction noise floor。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，5-class F1 降至 ~0.50，相比 3-class 的 0.762 大幅下降。Ordinal methods （CORAL, Frank-Hall）未能改善——这说明 depth signal 的 resolution ceiling 在 3 class， 不是分类方法的选择问题而是 feature space 的固有限制。Gen-1/gen-2 boundary 贡献了 86% 的 binary errors（作为 FN），因为 gen-1 和 gen-2 在 feature space 中高度重叠。 Gen-3 vs gen-4 几乎不可分（F1≈0.35）。审稿人在 best 档下接受 3-class 为 practical ceiling，论文诚实报告这一限制为 strength。5-class 负面结果排除了 \\\"只要用更好方法就能 区分更多 depth\\\" 的替代假说。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"human_edit_robustness\",\n    \"description\": \"鲁棒性测试：(A) Random word replacement (5/10/20%)，(B) LLM-simulated editing\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_binary_f1\": 0.695,\n      \"random_5pct_f1\": 0.65,\n      \"random_10pct_f1\": 0.614,\n      \"random_20pct_f1\": 0.591,\n      \"llm_rephrase_binary_f1\": 0.647,\n      \"llm_rephrase_multiclass_f1\": 0.667,\n      \"llm_edit_distance_ratio\": 0.507,\n      \"llm_avg_sentences_replaced\": 1.69,\n      \"drop_5pct\": \"−0.046\",\n      \"drop_10pct\": \"−0.081\",\n      \"drop_20pct\": \"−0.104\",\n      \"drop_llm\": \"−0.045\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.5: Robustness to text editing\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Binary F1\",\n          \"Δ vs baseline\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"No editing (baseline)\",\n            0.695,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5% random replacement\",\n            0.65,\n            \"−0.046\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"10% random replacement\",\n            0.614,\n            \"−0.081\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"20% random replacement\",\n            0.591,\n            \"−0.104\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LLM rephrase (avg 1.69 sent)\",\n            0.647,\n            \"−0.045\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LLM rephrase 与 5% random 的 drop 相近这一发现本身有价值：LLM editing 的特征空间扰动 并不比 naive random replacement 更具破坏性，可能因为 LLM editing 保持了文本的局部统计 一致性（不引入 out-of-distribution tokens）。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，depth signal 对 human editing 展现 graceful degradation。5% random noise 仅降 4.6 pp，LLM rephrase（平均替换 1.69 句，编辑距离 50.7%）降 4.5 pp——两者接近， 因为 LLM rephrase 虽然更自然但实际修改幅度（50.7% edit distance）与 5% random 在 feature 空间的扰动量级相当。20% random 的 10.4 pp drop 仍保持 F1>0.59（>random baseline）， 说明 depth signal 不完全依赖逐字保真。审稿人在 best 档下将 graceful degradation 视为 positive——完全抵抗 editing 是不现实的，important 是 degradation curve 平滑且 在 realistic editing level（5–10%）下性能损失可控。LLM rephrase 结果直接回应 RC5。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ld_score_feature\",\n    \"description\": \"添加 LD-Score（character-level distributional signature）作为额外特征\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seven_feature_f1\": 0.798,\n      \"eight_feature_with_ld_f1\": 0.803,\n      \"ld_score_only_f1\": 0.721,\n      \"ld_score_spearman_depth\": \"−0.794\",\n      \"delta_with_ld\": 0.005,\n      \"ld_feature_importance_rank\": 4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.6: LD-Score augmentation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Feature Set\",\n          \"LOGO F1\",\n          \"Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"7-feature (default)\",\n            0.798,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"7-feature + LD-Score\",\n            0.803,\n            0.005\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LD-Score only\",\n            0.721,\n            \"−0.077\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LD-Score 的 marginal contribution 较小（+0.5 pp），确认 7-feature set 已捕获大部分 depth signal。Character-level 信息主要通过 character frequency distribution 的 shift 反映 vocabulary impoverishment，与 TTR/hapax 高度相关。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，LD-Score 作为 character-level 特征与 token-level reference 特征部分互补， 加入后 LOGO F1 提升 0.5 pp（0.798→0.803），统计上显著但 practical 提升有限。 LD-Score 单独的 F1=0.721 介于 surface-only（0.688）和 reference-only（0.713）之间， Spearman ρ=−0.794 表明其与 depth 有强负相关。Feature importance 排第 4（在 hapax, ttr, entropy_mean 之后），说明 LD-Score 捕获的信号与 reference 特征高度 correlated 但非完全冗余。审稿人在 best 档下接受将 LD-Score 作为 supplementary evidence， 论文在 appendix 中报告此结果。7-feature 仍为 primary model 以保持简洁性。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"end_to_end_classifier\",\n    \"description\": \"QLoRA fine-tuned model 进行端到端 depth classification， 比较 learned representations vs handcrafted features\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qlora_olmo_instruct_3class_f1\": 0.888,\n      \"qlora_qwen_instruct_3class_f1\": 0.907,\n      \"qlora_olmo_base_3class_f1\": 0.859,\n      \"qlora_qwen_base_3class_f1\": 0.904,\n      \"qlora_olmo_instruct_binary_f1\": 0.836,\n      \"qlora_qwen_instruct_binary_f1\": 0.867,\n      \"qlora_olmo_base_binary_f1\": 0.793,\n      \"qlora_qwen_base_binary_f1\": 0.86,\n      \"qlora_5class_best_f1\": 0.597,\n      \"seven_feature_3class_f1\": 0.762,\n      \"delta_3class\": \"+12.6–14.5 pp\",\n      \"inference_cost_ratio\": \"~15×\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.7: End-to-end QLoRA vs 7-feature ensemble\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Type\",\n          \"3-class F1\",\n          \"Binary F1\",\n          \"5-class F1\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-1.7B (instruct)\",\n            \"QLoRA\",\n            0.907,\n            0.867,\n            0.551\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-1B (instruct)\",\n            \"QLoRA\",\n            0.888,\n            0.836,\n            0.598\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-1.7B (base)\",\n            \"QLoRA\",\n            0.904,\n            0.86,\n            0.554\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-1B (base)\",\n            \"QLoRA\",\n            0.859,\n            0.793,\n            0.54\n          ],\n          [\n            \"7-feature ensemble\",\n            \"XGBoost\",\n            0.762,\n            0.694,\n            0.5\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"QLoRA 的成功并不削弱 7-feature 的贡献：(1) 7-feature 提供了可解释的 DDR 框架，QLoRA 是 black box；(2) 7-feature 的 reference model 仅 410M，QLoRA 需 1.7B+；(3) QLoRA 同样 受 5-class ceiling 限制，确认这是 task boundary 而非 method limitation。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，QLoRA fine-tuned models 以 3-class F1 0.859–0.907 大幅超越 7-feature ensemble 的 0.762（+10–15 pp），证明 learned representations 能捕获 handcrafted features 遗漏的深层信号。但 5-class F1 仍仅 ~0.60，说明 resolution ceiling 是 task-intrinsic 而非 feature engineering 限制。Binary F1 提升较小（0.793–0.867 vs 0.694）， 因为 binary task 的 bottleneck 在 gen-1/gen-2+ 边界，learned features 也难以完全突破。 Instruct model 意外地与 base model 表现接近甚至略优（OLMo instruct 0.888 vs base 0.859）， 因为 QLoRA 的端到端学习可以 bypass DDR degradation，直接从 raw text 学习 depth pattern。 审稿人在 best 档下接受 7-feature 的定位转换：不追求绝对最优，而是 efficiency advantage（单次 Pythia-410M forward pass vs QLoRA 推理的 ~15× 成本差距）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"text_length_control\",\n    \"description\": \"文本长度 confound 控制：分析长度分布、length-normalized features、length-matched evaluation\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"length_depth_spearman_range\": \"[−0.066, +0.134]\",\n      \"length_is_confound\": false,\n      \"normalized_ttr_trend_preserved\": true,\n      \"normalized_hapax_trend_preserved\": true,\n      \"normalized_rho_stronger\": true,\n      \"length_matched_f1\": 0.724,\n      \"unmatched_f1\": 0.77,\n      \"length_matched_delta\": \"−0.046\",\n      \"dropout_short_text_bias\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.8: Length confound analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Binary F1\",\n          \"Δ vs unmatched\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Unmatched (full)\",\n            0.77,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Length-matched\",\n            0.724,\n            \"−0.046\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random subsample control\",\n            0.724,\n            \"−0.046\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Length confound 是 reviewer 高频关注点（RC10）。−4.6 pp drop 的来源是 deconfounding 而非信息损失，这通过 random subsample control 证实。Length-matched F1=0.724 可作为 conservative lower bound 报告在 abstract 中。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，text length 与 depth 的 Spearman ρ 在 [−0.066, +0.134] 范围内（弱相关）， 排除 length 作为主要 confound。Length-normalized features（TTR, hapax 在 fixed-length window 上计算）保持甚至增强了 depth 趋势（normalized ρ stronger），说明 DDR drift 不是 length artifact。Length-matched 后 F1 从 0.770 降至 0.724（−4.6 pp），但对照实验确认 这一 drop 来自 deconfounding 而非 sample size reduction（random subsample control 也降 相同幅度）。Depth 增加→更多短文本 dropout 的 bias 被确认，但通过 length matching 控制后 signal 仍然显著（0.724 >> 0.5）。审稿人在 best 档下接受 length-matched 0.724 作为 conservative 的 deconfounded 估计。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"large_scale_generator\",\n    \"description\": \"添加 7B+ generator（Qwen3-8B-Base）测试 frontier scale 下的 depth signal\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 4497,\n      \"unique_seeds\": 995,\n      \"depth_dist\": {\n        \"0\": 995,\n        \"1\": 979,\n        \"2\": 937,\n        \"3\": 831,\n        \"4\": 755\n      },\n      \"logo_6gen_avg_f1\": 0.789,\n      \"qwen3_8b_held_out_f1\": 0.683,\n      \"logo_5gen_baseline_f1\": 0.8,\n      \"spearman_hapax\": \"−0.558\",\n      \"spearman_ttr\": \"−0.542\",\n      \"spearman_entropy_mean\": \"−0.475\",\n      \"spearman_tail_decay\": \"−0.089\",\n      \"feature_importance_top3\": [\n        \"hapax_ratio (0.269)\",\n        \"entropy_mean (0.164)\",\n        \"ttr (0.159)\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 11: 6-generator LOGO with Qwen3-8B\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Generator\",\n          \"LOGO F1\",\n          \"hapax ρ\",\n          \"Scale\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Pythia-1B\",\n            0.856,\n            \"−0.65\",\n            \"1.0B\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-0.6B\",\n            0.824,\n            \"−0.63\",\n            \"0.6B\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-1.7B\",\n            0.805,\n            \"−0.61\",\n            \"1.7B\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pythia-2.8B\",\n            0.804,\n            \"−0.63\",\n            \"2.8B\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n            0.764,\n            \"−0.60\",\n            \"1.5B\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            0.683,\n            \"−0.56\",\n            \"8.0B\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Scale degradation 是最重要的 scope limitation 之一。6-gen LOGO 加入 8B 后均值从 0.800 降至 0.789，Qwen3-8B 拉低了整体。但 DDR pattern（drifting vs stationary）在 8B 下完全 保持，说明这是 amplitude reduction 而非 qualitative change。Feature importance 排序 不变（hapax > entropy_mean > ttr），confirmed DDR 的 cross-scale robustness。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，Qwen3-8B held-out F1=0.683 低于 6-gen 平均 0.789（−10.6 pp）， 证实 larger models 产生更弱的 depth signal。物理解释：8B 模型的更高容量压缩了 depth-wise feature margins——更强的 language model 在每步生成中保持了更接近 source distribution 的输出，DDR location shift 幅度减小。但 0.683 仍显著高于 random（0.5）， 且 DDR 方向一致（hapax ρ=−0.558, tail_decay ρ=−0.089 仍为 stationary）。 审稿人在 best 档下接受 scale effect 作为 honest limitation with analysis， 而非 fatal flaw——0.683 在 8B scale 下仍为 non-trivial signal。Depth retention 从 d0 到 d4 降至 0.759（995→755），高 dropout 率部分解释了 F1 下降。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ordinal_baseline_comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"关键 baseline：测试现有 detector（FastDetectGPT, Binoculars, LD-Score）的连续分数 是否已提供 ordinal depth signal\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seven_feature_logo_f1\": 0.798,\n      \"seven_feature_ci\": [\n        0.786,\n        0.799\n      ],\n      \"avg_logprob_logo_f1\": 0.765,\n      \"avg_logprob_ci\": [\n        0.616,\n        0.82\n      ],\n      \"ld_score_logo_f1\": 0.721,\n      \"ld_score_ci\": [\n        0.588,\n        0.77\n      ],\n      \"fast_detect_gpt_logo_f1\": 0.627,\n      \"fast_detect_gpt_ci\": [\n        0.511,\n        0.762\n      ],\n      \"binoculars_logo_f1\": 0.579,\n      \"binoculars_ci\": [\n        0.405,\n        0.664\n      ],\n      \"bootstrap_7feat_vs_avglogprob\": {\n        \"delta\": 0.039,\n        \"p\": 0.0,\n        \"significant\": true\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_7feat_vs_fdgpt\": {\n        \"delta\": 0.067,\n        \"p\": 0.0,\n        \"significant\": true\n      },\n      \"best_single_detector\": \"Avg-LogProb (0.765)\",\n      \"seven_feature_advantage_pp\": 3.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 5: Ordinal baseline comparison (LOGO)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"LOGO F1\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"Spearman ρ\",\n          \"Δ vs 7-feature\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"7-feature ensemble\",\n            0.798,\n            \"[0.786, 0.799]\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Avg-LogProb\",\n            0.765,\n            \"[0.616, 0.820]\",\n            0.788,\n            \"−0.033\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LD-Score\",\n            0.721,\n            \"[0.588, 0.770]\",\n            0.794,\n            \"−0.077\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FastDetectGPT\",\n            0.627,\n            \"[0.511, 0.762]\",\n            0.433,\n            \"−0.171\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Binoculars\",\n            0.579,\n            \"[0.405, 0.664]\",\n            0.199,\n            \"−0.219\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是论文中最关键的 baseline comparison——如果 Avg-LogProb alone 达到 0.80+，7-feature 的 contribution 就会被严重削弱。0.765 vs 0.798 的差距虽小但真实：7-feature 的优势 集中在 cross-generator 泛化（更窄 CI）和 gen-0 discrimination（surface features 必需）。 Binoculars 的 bug fix（denominator 从 CE(performer, obs_argmax) 改为 CE(performer, shifted_ids)）确保了公平比较。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，7-feature ensemble（0.798）显著优于所有 single-detector baselines （bootstrap p=0 for all pairwise comparisons）。最强 baseline Avg-LogProb（0.765） 差 3.3 pp，这一差距虽不大但统计显著——关键在于 7-feature 的 CI [0.786, 0.799] 与 Avg-LogProb 的 CI [0.616, 0.820] 不重叠于下界。Avg-LogProb 的强表现说明 ordinal depth signal 部分可被简单的 log-probability 特征捕获（Spearman ρ=0.788），但 7-feature 通过 组合 drifting + stationary 特征实现了更稳定的跨生成器泛化（更窄的 CI）。 FastDetectGPT（0.627）和 Binoculars（0.579）表现较差，因为它们设计为 binary detectors， 连续分数的 ordinal sensitivity 有限。LD-Score（0.721）居中，character-level 信息 提供了中等 ordinal signal。审稿人在 best 档下接受 7-feature 的优势为 \\\"modest but consistent\\\"——贡献不在于绝对性能碾压，而在于 DDR 框架的可解释性和互补性。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"9gen_scale_evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"扩展至 9 generators（+Gemma-2-2B, Llama-3.2-3B, Mistral-7B-v0.3）， 验证 8→9 gen 的 scaling behavior\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"9gen_logo_3class_f1\": 0.751,\n      \"9gen_logo_binary_f1\": 0.666,\n      \"8gen_baseline_3class_f1\": 0.77,\n      \"delta_9gen_vs_8gen\": \"−0.019\",\n      \"gemma_held_out_3class_f1\": 0.628,\n      \"gemma_held_out_binary_f1\": 0.44,\n      \"mistral_held_out_3class_f1\": 0.605,\n      \"mistral_held_out_binary_f1\": 0.633,\n      \"n_generators\": 9,\n      \"n_total_rows\": 42015\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.9: 9-generator per-generator LOGO F1\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Generator\",\n          \"3-class F1\",\n          \"Binary F1\",\n          \"Family\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Pythia-1B\",\n            0.857,\n            0.724,\n            \"Pythia\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-0.6B\",\n            0.819,\n            0.71,\n            \"Qwen\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pythia-2.8B\",\n            0.812,\n            0.7,\n            \"Pythia\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-1.7B\",\n            0.811,\n            0.698,\n            \"Qwen\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n            0.773,\n            0.663,\n            \"OLMo\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.2-3B\",\n            0.759,\n            0.68,\n            \"Llama\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            0.696,\n            0.647,\n            \"Qwen\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gemma-2-2B\",\n            0.628,\n            0.44,\n            \"Gemma\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n            0.605,\n            0.633,\n            \"Mistral\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"9-gen 是 thoroughness 的体现。Gemma anomaly 提供了 negative case study：当 tokenizer 差异过大时，cross-model reference 特征的假设被违反。这实际上深化了 DDR 的理解—— DDR 依赖于 reference model 与 generator 之间的 tokenizer compatibility。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，9-gen LOGO 3-class F1=0.751 较 8-gen 的 0.770 降 1.9 pp，主要由 Gemma-2-2B 的异常表现拉低（gen-1 F1=0.036）。Gemma 的异常来自其独特的 tokenizer （SentencePiece vs BPE）导致 reference model 特征提取偏移。Mistral-7B 的 0.605 反映了 7B scale 的 signal compression（与 plan_014 Qwen3-8B 的 0.696 一致）。 审稿人在 best 档下接受 Gemma anomaly 作为 honest outlier analysis（appendix 中详细 讨论 tokenizer mismatch），8-gen 结果作为 primary metric，9-gen 作为 robustness check。 Binary F1 0.666 是 conservative lower bound——Gemma 的 binary F1=0.440 接近 random。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ddr_causality_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"DDR causality analysis: permutation importance + Granger causality + feature intervention\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"permutation_baseline_f1\": 0.771,\n      \"drifting_avg_importance\": 0.158,\n      \"stationary_avg_importance\": 0.03,\n      \"drifting_stationary_ratio\": 5.31,\n      \"granger_significant_features\": \"6/7\",\n      \"granger_nonsig_feature\": \"entropy_min\",\n      \"granger_max_delta_r2\": 0.031,\n      \"granger_panel_n\": 29095,\n      \"intervention_max_f1_drop\": 0.02\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 6: DDR causality analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Feature\",\n          \"Perm Importance\",\n          \"Granger sig\",\n          \"Category\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"hapax_ratio\",\n            0.289,\n            \"✓ (p<0.001)\",\n            \"Drifting\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ttr\",\n            0.168,\n            \"✓ (p<0.001)\",\n            \"Drifting\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"entropy_mean\",\n            0.16,\n            \"✓ (p<0.001)\",\n            \"Drifting\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"entropy_std\",\n            0.046,\n            \"✓ (p<0.05)\",\n            \"Stationary\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"entropy_max\",\n            0.063,\n            \"✓ (p<0.01)\",\n            \"Stationary\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"entropy_min\",\n            0.015,\n            \"✗ (p=0.12)\",\n            \"Stationary\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"tail_decay\",\n            0.012,\n            \"✓ (p<0.05)\",\n            \"Stationary\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Causality analysis 是论文从 \\\"observation\\\" 升级到 \\\"empirical contribution\\\" 的关键。 仅报告 DDR correlation 会被审稿人视为 descriptive；加入 Granger + permutation + intervention 三角验证后，DDR 的 causal status 被充分支撑。entropy_min 的 Granger 不显著实际上增强了可信度——不是所有特征都需要 causal relationship。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，drifting/stationary 分离经三重 causality test 验证：(1) Permutation importance 5.3× gap（drifting 0.158 vs stationary 0.030）确认 drifting 特征对分类的 贡献远超 stationary；(2) 6/7 Granger 显著（仅 entropy_min 不显著）确认 depth→feature 的 temporal causality；(3) Feature intervention 的最大 F1 drop 仅 0.020 pp 表明 单特征 intervention 不足以破坏分类——signal 分布在 drifting 特征组合中。 审稿人在 best 档下将这组 causality evidence 视为 \\\"sufficient\\\" 而非 \\\"mere correlation\\\"， 认可 DDR 作为 genuine empirical contribution 而非 vocabulary impoverishment 的重新包装。 5.5× permutation gap + 6/7 Granger 的组合在 Findings 级别属于 strong evidence。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tost_bootstrap_stability\",\n    \"description\": \"TOST bootstrap 验证 stationary 特征的稳定性\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_bootstrap\": 1000,\n      \"margin_d\": 0.2,\n      \"entropy_max\": {\n        \"median_p\": 0.0,\n        \"rejection_rate\": 1.0,\n        \"median_d\": 0.062\n      },\n      \"entropy_min\": {\n        \"median_p\": 0.0,\n        \"rejection_rate\": 1.0,\n        \"median_d\": \"−0.016\"\n      },\n      \"tail_decay\": {\n        \"median_p\": 0.0,\n        \"rejection_rate\": 1.0,\n        \"median_d\": 0.088\n      },\n      \"entropy_std\": {\n        \"median_p\": 1.0,\n        \"rejection_rate\": 0.0,\n        \"median_d\": 0.458\n      },\n      \"stationary_features_robust\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.10: TOST bootstrap stationarity test\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Feature\",\n          \"Median d\",\n          \"TOST p\",\n          \"Rejection Rate\",\n          \"Status\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"entropy_max\",\n            0.062,\n            0.0,\n            1.0,\n            \"Stationary ✓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"entropy_min\",\n            \"−0.016\",\n            0.0,\n            1.0,\n            \"Stationary ✓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"tail_decay\",\n            0.088,\n            0.0,\n            1.0,\n            \"Stationary ✓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"entropy_std\",\n            0.458,\n            1.0,\n            0.0,\n            \"Intermediate (rejected)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"TOST bootstrap 为 DDR 分离提供了比 Spearman ρ 更严格的统计基础。entropy_std 的 intermediate status 实际上加强了论文的 nuance——不是简单的二分法，而是一个连续谱， 论文选择在 practical level 上维持 drifting/stationary 二分以保持 clarity。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，TOST bootstrap 确认 3/4 stationary-candidate 特征在 d=0.2 margin 下 统计等价于 depth-invariant（rejection rate=100%, median d<0.1）。entropy_std 被拒绝 （median d=0.458, rejection rate=0%），因为它虽然 Spearman ρ 低（−0.12）但 effect size 超出 equivalence margin——entropy_std 是 \\\"weak drifter\\\" 而非 true stationary。 这一发现精细化了 DDR 分类：3 strong drifters (hapax, TTR, entropy_mean) + 3 true stationary (entropy_max, entropy_min, tail_decay) + 1 intermediate (entropy_std)。 审稿人在 best 档下接受 TOST 作为比 ρ 更严格的 stationarity test，entropy_std 的 intermediate status 被视为 nuanced finding 而非 inconsistency。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"instruct_model_degradation\",\n    \"description\": \"三个 instruct model（Qwen3-1.7B, OLMo-2-1B, Llama-3.2-3B）的 DDR 退化分析\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_instruct_logo_binary\": 0.658,\n      \"olmo_instruct_within_3class\": 0.575,\n      \"llama_instruct_3class\": 0.544,\n      \"qwen_base_logo_binary\": 0.821,\n      \"delta_logo_binary_qwen\": \"−0.163\",\n      \"features_reversed_olmo\": \"6/7\",\n      \"features_reversed_llama\": \"3/7 (entropy_mean, entropy_std, tail_decay)\",\n      \"spearman_direction_reversal\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table 12: Instruct vs base model comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Type\",\n          \"LOGO Binary F1\",\n          \"3-class F1\",\n          \"Features Reversed\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-1.7B\",\n            \"Base\",\n            0.821,\n            0.769,\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-1.7B\",\n            \"Instruct\",\n            0.658,\n            0.543,\n            \"ρ direction\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n            \"Base\",\n            0.845,\n            0.754,\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-2-1B\",\n            \"Instruct\",\n            0.813,\n            0.575,\n            \"6/7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.2-3B\",\n            \"Base\",\n            0.849,\n            0.742,\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.2-3B\",\n            \"Instruct\",\n            0.838,\n            0.544,\n            \"3/7\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Instruct 退化的 mechanism analysis（feature reversal, not just signal weakening）是 超越简单 \\\"instruct doesn't work\\\" 报告的 value-add。Format compliance hypothesis 可 在 future work 中通过 constrained decoding 实验验证。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，instruct model 的 DDR 退化被系统性确认：LOGO binary F1 从 base 0.821 降至 instruct 0.658（Qwen, −16.3 pp），OLMo instruct 的 6/7 features Spearman 方向 反转（ρ 从负变正），说明 instruction tuning 的 length regulation 和 format constraints 根本性地改变了 depth-feature relationship。物理解释：alignment 训练强制模型在所有 depth 上产生相似的 token distribution（format compliance），压缩了 DDR 依赖的 distributional variation。这是 base-model-only scope 的核心证据。审稿人在 best 档下 将诚实报告视为 strength：不隐藏 limitation，反而深入分析其 mechanism（feature reversal + format compression hypothesis）。0 instruct scope penalty。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"temperature_sensitivity\",\n    \"description\": \"Temperature sensitivity curve (t=0.5, 0.7, 0.9, 1.0) + cross-temperature transfer\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"t05_logo_binary_f1\": 0.814,\n      \"t07_logo_binary_f1\": 0.694,\n      \"t09_logo_binary_f1\": 0.48,\n      \"within_t07_binary\": 0.947,\n      \"cross_t07_to_t10_binary\": 0.9,\n      \"cross_t07_to_t10_qwen_only_binary\": 0.757,\n      \"cross_t07_to_t10_qwen_only_3class\": 0.458,\n      \"entropy_mean_rho_t05\": \"−0.584\",\n      \"entropy_mean_rho_t07\": \"−0.600\",\n      \"entropy_mean_rho_t09\": \"−0.302\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.4: Temperature sensitivity\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Temperature\",\n          \"Within-CV Binary F1\",\n          \"LOGO Binary F1\",\n          \"entropy_mean ρ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            0.5,\n            0.843,\n            0.814,\n            \"−0.584\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.7 (default)\",\n            0.947,\n            0.694,\n            \"−0.600\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.9,\n            0.582,\n            0.48,\n            \"−0.302\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Temperature sensitivity 直接关联 DDR 的 location-shift 解释：高温增大了每步采样的 distributional noise，削弱了 deterministic drift component。t=0.5 下 signal 更强 因为低温采样更 deterministic，location shift 更 clean。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，DDR 在 t∈[0.5, 0.7] 范围内稳定（≤1 pp degradation from default）， t=0.9 大幅退化（−21.4 pp），t=1.0 进一步恶化。Cross-temperature transfer 严重不对称： t=0.7→t=1.0 降 16.9 pp（Qwen-only binary），t=1.0→t=0.7 仅降微弱。物理解释： 高温增大 sampling noise，entropy_mean 的 depth-wise drift 被 within-depth variance 淹没（ρ 从 −0.60 降至 −0.002 at t=1.0）。审稿人在 best 档下接受 t∈[0.5, 0.9] 为 reliable range，t=1.0 degradation 作为 transparent limitation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"independent_seed_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"Independent seed validation：不同生成器使用完全独立的 seed 集\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"pythia_to_olmo_binary_f1\": 0.695,\n      \"olmo_to_pythia_binary_f1\": 0.666,\n      \"avg_binary_f1\": 0.68,\n      \"shared_seed_logo_ref\": 0.694,\n      \"delta_vs_shared\": \"−0.014\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.11: Independent vs shared seed evaluation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Binary F1\",\n          \"Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Shared seed LOGO\",\n            0.694,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Independent seed (Pythia→OLMo)\",\n            0.695,\n            0.001\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Independent seed (OLMo→Pythia)\",\n            0.666,\n            \"−0.028\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Independent seed avg\",\n            0.68,\n            \"−0.014\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Independent seed validation 关闭了 seed sharing leakage 的替代假说。 1.4 pp 差异可归因于 generator-specific difficulty 差异而非 leakage。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，independent seed 的 avg binary F1=0.680 vs shared seed LOGO 0.694 仅差 1.4 pp，确认 shared seed 不构成显著 leakage。这排除了 \\\"performance inflated by seed sharing\\\" 的 critique。1.4 pp 差异在 bootstrap CI 内，不具统计显著性。 方向不对称（Pythia→OLMo 0.695 vs OLMo→Pythia 0.666）反映了 OLMo 作为 test set 更难分类（与 LOGO 结果一致）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"topic_drift_control\",\n    \"description\": \"Semantic similarity analysis：控制 topic drift 作为 depth signal 的 confound\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sim_0_to_1\": 0.622,\n      \"sim_1_to_2\": 0.683,\n      \"sim_2_to_3\": 0.801,\n      \"sim_3_to_4\": 0.859,\n      \"shape_entropy_std_rho\": \"−0.164\",\n      \"shape_tail_decay_rho\": 0.068,\n      \"drifting_entropy_mean_rho\": \"−0.286\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.12: Semantic similarity by depth transition\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Transition\",\n          \"Mean Sim\",\n          \"Std\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"depth 0→1\",\n            0.622,\n            0.165\n          ],\n          [\n            \"depth 1→2\",\n            0.683,\n            0.184\n          ],\n          [\n            \"depth 2→3\",\n            0.801,\n            0.201\n          ],\n          [\n            \"depth 3→4\",\n            0.859,\n            0.19\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Semantic convergence 与 vocabulary impoverishment 是相关但不同的现象：text 变得 semantically more similar（topic narrowing）但 statistically less diverse（DDR drift）。 两者的解耦证明 DDR 不是 topic drift 的简单 proxy。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，semantic similarity 随 depth 递增（0.622→0.859），表明 deeper generation 趋向 semantic convergence（repetition/narrowing）。但 DDR feature-depth correlations 在控制 semantic similarity 后仍保持方向和显著性，说明 DDR 不仅仅是 topic drift 的 proxy。Shape features 与 semantic similarity 的 correlation 极弱（|ρ|<0.17）， 进一步确认 shape stationarity 独立于 topic dynamics。审稿人在 best 档下接受 topic drift 分析为 adequate confound control。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"multi_detector_ensemble\",\n    \"description\": \"Multi-detector ensemble（4 detectors + surface features）vs 7-feature baseline\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"four_det_surface_3class_f1\": 0.795,\n      \"four_det_surface_binary_f1\": 0.708,\n      \"seven_feature_3class_f1\": 0.774,\n      \"seven_feature_binary_f1\": 0.705,\n      \"delta_3class\": 0.021,\n      \"delta_binary\": 0.003,\n      \"inference_cost_ratio\": 2.4,\n      \"gpu_memory_ratio\": 3.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Table A.1: Multi-detector ensemble comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"3-class F1\",\n          \"Binary F1\",\n          \"Cost Ratio\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"7-feature ensemble\",\n            0.774,\n            0.705,\n            \"1.0×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4-det + surface\",\n            0.795,\n            0.708,\n            \"2.4×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Multi-detector ensemble 的 marginal gains 进一步验证了 7-feature 的 cost-effectiveness。 3-class 差距 2.1 pp 大于 binary 0.3 pp，因为额外 detector features 主要帮助 gen-0/gen-1 区分（通过 detector-specific calibration），对 gen-1/gen-2+ boundary 几乎无效。\\n\\n在 best 档下，multi-detector ensemble 以 +2.1 pp (3-class) 和 +0.3 pp (binary) 微弱优于 7-feature，但代价是 2.4× inference cost 和 3.2× GPU memory。Binary F1 差距仅 0.3 pp（essentially equivalent），因为 binary task 的 gen-1/gen-2+ 边界是 intrinsic bottleneck，更多 features 无法突破。7-feature 的 efficiency advantage 在 best 档下被审稿人接受为合理的 positioning：not absolute best, but best cost-performance tradeoff。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1449,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1449}}}
